hubusercontent.com/u/71704013?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/laithalenooz","id":71704013,"login":"laithalenooz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzA0MDEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca-plugin-dashboard/commits/878f0d34e0c87253168d5eaa490ab62bcc6df39a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:19:43Z","email":"laithalenooz@gmail.com","name":"laithalenooz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:19:43Z","email":"laithalenooz@gmail.com","name":"laithalenooz"},"message":"fix(presets): make the burndown and burnup presets pass the query guard (#11)\n\nThe \"Burndown (active sprint)\" and \"Burnup (active sprint)\" presets in the\nfrontend, and the burndown preset in the paca-dashboard-builder skill, used\nUNION ALL and repeated {{project_id}} inside nested subqueries. The guard\nrejects both (compound SELECTs are forbidden because a second branch escapes\nthe project filter; the placeholder must appear once, as a top-level\nequality), so these presets failed the moment anyone used them.\n\nThey now select the most recently started active sprint in the outer query\nand produce one row per day from its start date to today with\ngenerate_series, counting scope and completed tasks with correlated\nsubqueries. The skill''s safety rules now state the single top-level\nplaceholder rule, the compound-SELECT ban and the subquery restriction for\ntables with sensitive columns.\n\nbackend/presets_test.go runs every preset shipped in presets.ts and in the\nskill through validateQuery, so an invalid preset fails the build.\n\nFixes #11","tree":{"sha":"cc524d0acfee1b6db9f10f24f27834c3a6743ed8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca-plugin-dashboard/git/trees/cc524d0acfee1b6db9f10f24f27834c3a6743ed8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Paca-AI/paca-plugin-dashboard/git/commits/878f0d34e0c87253168d5eaa490ab62bcc6df39a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71704013?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/laithalenooz","id":71704013,"login":"laithalenooz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzA0MDEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/laithalenooz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Paca-AI/paca-plugin-dashboard/commit/878f0d34e0c87253168d5eaa490ab62bcc6df39a","node_id":"C_kwDOTcpzydoAKDg3OGYwZDM0ZTBjODcyNTMxNjhkNWVhYTQ5MGFiNjJiY2M2ZGYzOWE","parents":[{"html_url":