"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buildpad-ai/skills/commits/58312b9348bb51e73b915441c5175b9c91c4d6de"}],"sha":"a2930d58caad0d5dc91858b8a4caddd74eac42a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buildpad-ai/skills/commits/a2930d58caad0d5dc91858b8a4caddd74eac42a1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43270872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rudyxtremax","id":43270872,"login":"rudyxtremax","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMjcwODcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buildpad-ai/skills/commits/58312b9348bb51e73b915441c5175b9c91c4d6de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T10:52:19Z","email":"rudy.prihantoro@xtremax.com","name":"Rudy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T10:52:19Z","email":"rudy.prihantoro@xtremax.com","name":"Rudy"},"message":"docs(create-workflow): correct the field payloads, gating and verification guidance\n\nFollowing the workflow skills against DaaS 0.1.98 and Buildpad UI 3.0.0\nproduced a setup that looked right and was not. Each correction below was\nreproduced against a live project.\n\n- workflow_instance is declared through meta.options.related_collection.\n  schema.foreign_key_table is not read on create (the Go engine refuses\n  it), so the field was a bare column and was never filled.\n- Relation fields (workflow_instance, user_created, user_updated) are\n  added with the fields tool after the collection exists. Listed inline\n  in the collections create call every uuid column gets a\n  gen_random_uuid() default: a random value that names nothing, or, once\n  the column has a foreign key, an insert that always fails.\n- An assignment has no name column and a definition has no status\n  column; both examples failed the create.\n- There is no MCP action that runs a transition. The\n  _workflow_transition example is replaced by the REST call and its\n  answers.\n- A command''s policies list takes policy ids, not daas_access ids, which\n  never match and lock the command for everyone.\n- Non-admins need read on daas_wf_instance and daas_wf_definition for\n  WorkflowButton to load.\n- New section: protecting the state field from direct writes, with the\n  filter extension that does it on the Next.js backend.\n- Verification steps check the relation, read the item back after the\n  create, and test the gate and the direct write as a non-admin.\n- grant-module-access imports usePermissions from @/lib/buildpad/hooks\n  and no longer puts isAdmin || in front of hasModuleAccess.\n\nBehaviour that depends on a release is worded as observed on DaaS 0.1.98\n/ Buildpad UI 3.0.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1140dd8d719283e1fa1943eeea8301815fe5bc1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buildpad-ai/skills/git/trees/1140dd8d719283e1fa1943eeea8301815fe5bc1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buildpad-ai/skills/git/commits/58312b9348bb51e73b915441c5175b9c91c4d6de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43270872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://ap