hout its document is not an empty machine.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0425d42efa63f12f347f05fabac5cbd5c1422eca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buildpad-ai/skills/git/trees/0425d42efa63f12f347f05fabac5cbd5c1422eca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buildpad-ai/skills/git/commits/b4a05c11d4a4391a00671724bd492546be37ec73","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43270872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rudyxtremax","id":43270872,"login":"rudyxtremax","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMjcwODcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/buildpad-ai/skills/commit/b4a05c11d4a4391a00671724bd492546be37ec73","node_id":"C_kwDOTc-XbtoAKGI0YTA1YzExZDRhNDM5MWEwMDY3MTcyNGJkNDkyNTQ2YmUzN2VjNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/buildpad-ai/skills/commit/e0d97e9943c0f4dc5e0c19d75aeabacf2d9c0417","sha":"e0d97e9943c0f4dc5e0c19d75aeabacf2d9c0417","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buildpad-ai/skills/commits/e0d97e9943c0f4dc5e0c19d75aeabacf2d9c0417"}],"sha":"b4a05c11d4a4391a00671724bd492546be37ec73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buildpad-ai/skills/commits/b4a05c11d4a4391a00671724bd492546be37ec73"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43270872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rudyxtremax","id":43270872,"login":"rudyxtremax","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMjcwODcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buildpad-ai/skills/commits/e0d97e9943c0f4dc5e0c19d75aeabacf2d9c0417/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:32:19Z","email":"rudy.prihantoro@xtremax.com","name":"Rudy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:32:19Z","email":"rudy.prihantoro@xtremax.com","name":"Rudy"},"message":"feat(add-workflows): Workflows module skill — /workflows diagram editor, assignments, instances\n\nA skill for the new @buildpad/ui-workflows module, in the shape of add-users\nand add-files: what the six screens are, the install command\n(`add workflows-routes`, or `add workflow-management` for the components\nalone), the @xyflow/react dependency, the routes, page wiring through router\ncallbacks (and the navigate-after-create rule), the data-layer hooks with\ntheir typed errors, and the access rules (collection gates; a command with\nneither policies nor module access keys is open to every signed-in user).\n\nUnlike the Files and Users modules it calls DaaS directly from the browser,\nso the skill tells the agent not to add api-routes for it.\n\nAlso lists the module where the others are listed (README, add-buildpad,\nadd-microapp, add-microfrontend, buildpad-reference), and links it from\ncreate-workflow, which now says how WorkflowButton gets its record key.\n\nDepends on the UI release that ships the module; the commands do not exist\nin the published CLI before it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6133777b384ddf1a10d65aeaf7a569220068290","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buildpad-ai/skills/git/trees/e6133777b384ddf1a10d65aeaf7a569220068290"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buildpad-ai/skills/git/commits/e0d97e9943c0f4dc5e0c19d75aeabacf2d9c0417","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43270872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rudyxtremax","id":43270872,"login":"rudyxtremax","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMjcwODcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/buildpad-ai/skills/commit/e0d97e9943c0f4dc5e0c19d75aeabacf2d