ing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rudyxtremax","id":43270872,"login":"rudyxtremax","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMjcwODcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rudyxtremax","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buildpad-ai/skills/commits/64063965e3375a47fbb509ce6b079491f456bbc7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T05:46:06Z","email":"rudy.prihantoro@xtremax.com","name":"Rudy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T05:46:06Z","email":"rudy.prihantoro@xtremax.com","name":"Rudy"},"message":"feat(add-i18n): internationalization skill — [lang] routing, dictionaries, DaaS content translations\n\nAdds the add-i18n module skill with two references:\n\n- locale-routing: locale config, Accept-Language/cookie negotiation composed\n  with the Supabase auth middleware, app/[lang] root layout, server-loaded\n  dictionaries handed to a client I18nProvider, locale-aware navigation,\n  LanguageSwitcher on SelectDropdown, micro-app propagation\n- content-translations: languages collection + <collection>_translations\n  junction created via the fields tool''s corresponding_field option (o2m\n  alias — DaaS''s `translations` special has no nested-write branch and\n  silently drops rows), SQL mirrors, permissions, query helpers with\n  default-locale fallback, per-locale workflow (Group B on the junction),\n  scope\n\nRegisters the skill in the README catalog.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"470e754bd