"id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/9c0349b06f8c994fb4716cbc1091821fc1fae23e","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKDljMDM0OWIwNmY4Yzk5NGZiNDcxNmNiYzEwOTE4MjFmYzFmYWUyM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/e99e0fea9e3f6fc94879966ea7d467316d6f72fa","sha":"e99e0fea9e3f6fc94879966ea7d467316d6f72fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/e99e0fea9e3f6fc94879966ea7d467316d6f72fa"}],"sha":"9c0349b06f8c994fb4716cbc1091821fc1fae23e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/9c0349b06f8c994fb4716cbc1091821fc1fae23e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/e99e0fea9e3f6fc94879966ea7d467316d6f72fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T22:34:03Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Mehmet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T22:34:03Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Mehmet"},"message":"fix(github): manual_review gates resolved/fixed; branch-fixable guards the fix path\n\nTwo related false-all-clear bugs in the GitHub fix pipeline:\n\n- github_exit_code (CLI) and the desktop github_fix `fixed` computation\n  both treated `pushed` non-empty as proof the default branch was fixed,\n  without consulting `manual_review`. fix_branch_tips appends cleaned\n  branch leaves to `pushed` and runs even when the default-branch fix\n  bailed to manual review (every soft-fail path there sets\n  manual_review=true with error=None), so a repo whose default branch\n  was still infected on origin could exit 0 / report `fixed: true` off\n  an unrelated branch-tip push. Both computations now also require\n  `!manual_review`.\n\n- fix_scanned gated branch cleaning on `opts.push` alone instead of\n  `sr.branch_fixable`. When a repo''s default_branch matches no listed\n  branch, every finding is git_ref-stamped (including the branch that''s\n  actually checked out on clone), so the old gate let the fix path\n  force-push-rewrite ALL branches — including the real default — without\n  the default path''s residual-verify safety, contradicting the scan-side\n  rationale for branch_fixable. Gate now also checks branch_fixable.\n\nRegression tests: push_with_manual_review_exits_1 (main.rs),\nunknown_default_branch_fix_does_not_rewrite_branches (pipeline.rs).\n\nAlso fixes a stale doc comment on GithubRepoView.fixable (branch-only\ninfected repos are fixable, not merely reported).","tree":{"sha":"d88f39afffa0a1525cf0000c1fea2bb2918668f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/d88f39afffa0a1525cf0000c1fea2bb2918668f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/e99e0fea9e3f6fc94879966ea7d467316d6f72fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/e99e0fea9e3f6fc94879966ea7d467316d6f72fa","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKGU5OWUwZmVhOWUzZjZmYzk0ODc5OTY2ZWE3ZDQ2NzMxNmQ2ZjcyZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/983d0a549398897f4e473cf41b5bc985f2306be8","sha":"983d0a549398897f4e473cf41b5bc985f2306be8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/983d0a549398897f4e473cf41b5bc985f2306be8"}],"sha":"e99e0fea9e3f6fc94879966ea7d467316d6f72fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/e99e0fea9e3f6fc94879966ea7d467316d6f72fa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/983d0a549398897f4e473cf41b5bc985f2306be8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T22:33:25Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Mehmet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T22:33:25Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Mehmet"},"message":"fix(core): verify branch cleans for residual payload before commit/push\n\nclean_in_worktree applied a branch''s remediation actions and committed/\npushed with no re-scan, so a signature sitting before the strip marker\n(surviving strip_after_marker, which only cuts from the marker onward)\nwas force-pushed as \"cleaned\" while still infected. Thread packs through\napply_branch_cleans/clean_branch/clean_in_worktree and re-scan the\nworktree before committing, mirroring the default-branch path''s own\nresidual-verify safety check; report BranchCleanStatus::Failed and leave\nthe already-created backup ref in place instead of committing/pushing a\nstill-infected file. Update the design spec to describe the real verify\nbehavior instead of asserting reused strip-and-verify logic that didn''t\nverify anything on this path.","tree":{"sha":"c3c521be58dca1146fb0c6ea8ebe80236576e52e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/c3c521be58dca1146fb0c6ea8ebe80236576e52e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/983d0a549398897f4e473cf41b5bc985f2306be8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/983d0a549398897f4e473cf41b5bc985f2306be8","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKDk4M2QwYTU0OTM5ODg5N2Y0ZTQ3M2NmNDFiNWJjOTg1ZjIzMDZiZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/8566f1fac9bca3a21ba21f2a14fdacf64bd35275","sha":"8566f1fac9bca3a21ba21f2a14fdacf64bd35275","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/8566f1fac9bca3a21ba21f2a14fdacf64bd35275"}],"sha":"983d0a549398897f4e473cf41b5bc985f2306be8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/983d0a54