"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/f8f0d1abe5fa2acf2a4e0986b7e8829bb25beb5b","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKGY4ZjBkMWFiZTVmYTJhY2YyYTRlMDk4NmI3ZTg4MjliYjI1YmViNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/52ed78f91a08018f4a03571967443343468aef86","sha":"52ed78f91a08018f4a03571967443343468aef86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/52ed78f91a08018f4a03571967443343468aef86"}],"sha":"f8f0d1abe5fa2acf2a4e0986b7e8829bb25beb5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/f8f0d1abe5fa2acf2a4e0986b7e8829bb25beb5b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/52ed78f91a08018f4a03571967443343468aef86/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T16:44:47Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Emir Unluturk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T16:44:47Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Emir Unluturk"},"message":"fix(core): eliminate three scan false-positive classes\n\nFound while triaging a real ~/repos scan: 9 of 30 findings were FPs.\n\n- exclude installed Python deps: add .venv/venv/site-packages to EXCLUDED_DIRS,\n  the Python peer of node_modules. A bundled Jupyter (plotly) extension there\n  tripped the capability engine''s obfuscation/network heuristics.\n- spare SVG mislabeled as a raster asset: starts_with_asset_magic now accepts\n  <?xml / <svg, so an SVG saved with a .png/.gif extension (benign mislabel)\n  no longer fires BinaryAsset magic-mismatch on an incidental \"function\" word.\n- stop flagging DEFENSIVE shell hooks: JS obfuscation tells (the _$_hex decoder\n  id, global.x= version tag) are inert data in a shell script — grep patterns or\n  comment examples in an anti-worm pre-commit hook. is_shell_script() suppresses\n  the JS-obfuscation concealment prior for #!-shell scripts, so a detector hook\n  is not flagged as the malware it detects. A genuinely malicious hook still\n  fires via the behavioral worm tells (self-propagation, download-exec, wipe,\n  exfil), and a #!node hook is a JS host so its obfuscation still counts. This\n  also clears the git-reflog-amend findings that cascaded off the hook''s Critical.","tree":{"sha":"9d6f5d1c46d9ab211b8e4b98f51c5fb2e20beabc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/9d6f5d1c46d9ab211b8e4b98f51c5fb2e20beabc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/52ed78f91a08018f4a03571967443343468aef86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/52ed78f91a08018f4a03571967443343468aef86","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKDUyZWQ3OGY5MWEwODAxOGY0YTAzNTcxOTY3NDQzMzQzNDY4YWVmODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/ad7bbcb765d473ab82ad920d843724e58c717aac","sha":"ad7bbcb765d473ab82ad920d843724e58c717aac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/ad7bbcb765d473ab82ad920d843724e58c717aac"}],"sha":"52ed78f91a08018f4a03571967443343468aef86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/52ed78f91a08018f4a03571967443343468aef86"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/ad7bbcb765d473ab82ad920d843724e58c717aac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T16:17:40Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Emir Unluturk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T16:17:40Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Emir Unluturk"},"message":"fix(desktop): honest per-finding fix label + consented branch-clean on results\n\nThe results pill read \"Removable automatically\" for branch-tip findings, but the\n\"Remove threats safely\" button only strips working-tree files (remediable &&\n!git_ref). So a repo whose infection lives on a remote branch tip (payload on\norigin/main, local files clean) showed N removable pills yet \"0 can be removed\"\nand no button — the pill promised an action nothing could perform.\n\n- Add fixClass()/fixLabel()/branchSelections() (findings.ts, unit-tested): every\n  finding is exactly auto (working-tree strip), branch (payload on a tip — fixable\n  only by rewriting history + force-push), or manual. FindingCard and the results\n  summary now share this one classifier, so pill and buttons can''t disagree.\n- FindingCard: branch-tip findings read \"Removable on branch\" (info tone), not\n  \"Removable automatically\".\n- ScanFlow results: summary counts auto/branch/manual separately, and a\n  \"Clean N infected branches (force-push)\" button routes through an explicit\n  confirmation dialog before calling clean_branches_apply(selected, push=true) —\n  the only way to fix a remote-tracking infection — then re-scans. The old tip of\n  each branch is preserved in refs/wormward-backup/…, so the push is recoverable.","tree":{"sha":"7a1948d636a06f4fd94e7d36c7d7538060383ca1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/7a1948d636a06f4fd94e7d36c7d7538060383ca1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/ad7bbcb765d473ab82ad920d843724e58c717aac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscripti