com> 1784641177 +0300\n\nfix(core): derive build-output scan list from EXCLUDED_DIRS — .nuxt/out/coverage/vendor were blind spots\n\n`.nuxt` (and `out`/`coverage`/`vendor`) were added to EXCLUDED_DIRS but not to the\nbuild-output scan list, leaving them excluded-but-uncovered — a hidden payload in a `.nuxt`\nbundle would be missed. Derive the strict hidden-payload scan targets from EXCLUDED_DIRS\n(minus node_modules [covered separately], target [no JS], .wormward-backup [ours]) so every\nexcluded JS dir is re-covered and a newly-excluded dir can never become a blind spot.\n\nTest: a decoder payload in each of .nuxt/out/coverage/vendor/dist is detected. Real projects\nre-scan (now incl. .nuxt/vendor/out/coverage) = 0 findings. Full workspace green, clippy clean.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal92mRsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQUrr2tOviBPtq6gEAzsDelyUmPGFkSkUr7vpf\n9phmGQunCONRcruM7wK3p6IBAMiLJ4kVTbUJjyhbfjokm+uAMKcfFW6gO0zD0h/z\nW3wI\n=1Ulj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-21T13:54:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.co