_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/d2a40fa14dbaab31a819f3a1bf6e4ec096a1503f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T13:21:56Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T13:21:56Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"message":"fix(core): FP-hunt hardening — process_spawn regex-exec, appended-blob string-array, .output/.nuxt\n\nWhole-machine probe (raw detectors over 177k legit node_modules/src JS) surfaced three\nfalse-positive classes — all latent (in excluded dirs) but real detector precision bugs:\n\n1. process_spawn matched a bare `exec(`, which is a JS regex/string `.exec()` (e.g.\n   @babel/parser) — the dominant class (combined with trailing code, it tripped the\n   ConfigFile gate). Dropped bare `exec(`; real child-process spawn always references\n   child_process / spawn / execSync / execFile / Bun.spawn, so no detection is lost.\n2. appended_obfuscated_blob fired on a large inline string-array tail with no execution\n   sink — a legit minified/bundled last line (e.g. @react-native/debugger-frontend). Now\n   requires an actual exec sink (eval/Function/atob/charcode) on the blob line.\n3. Nuxt/Nitro `.output` and `.nuxt` build-output dirs were not excluded; added them (the\n   only two non-excluded probe hits were `.output/server/*.mjs` bundles).\n\nRe-probe over the previously-hit files: 832 -> 481 (the rest is the structural capability\ngate, which is why these dirs are excluded). Full workspace green, clippy clean.","tree":{"sha":"3b85738ac86fb49ff6817072cc682f5dfbe717ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/3b85738ac86fb49ff6817072cc682f5dfbe717ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/d2a40fa14dbaab31a819f3a1bf6e4ec096a1503f","verification":{"payload":"tree 3b85738ac86fb49ff6817072cc682f5dfbe717ba\nparent f743c1ca838fef5465deb4b5701f8f85ef4164f1\nauthor 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784640116 +0300\ncommitter 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784640116 +0300\n\nfix(core): FP-hunt hardening — process_spawn regex-exec, appended-blob string-array, .output/.nuxt\n\nWhole-machine probe (raw detectors over 177k legit node_modules/src JS) surfaced three\nfalse-positive classes — all latent (in excluded dirs) but real detector precision bugs:\n\n1. process_spawn matched a bare `exec(`, which is a JS regex/string `.exec()` (e.g.\n   @babel/parser) — the dominant class (combined with trailing code, it tripped the\n   ConfigFile gate). Dropped bare `exec(`; real child-process spawn always references\n   child_process / spawn / execSync / execFile / Bun.spawn, so no detection is lost.\n2. appended_obfuscated_blob fired on a large inline string-array tail with no execution\n   sink — a legit minified/bundled last line (e.g. @react-native/debugger-frontend). Now\n   requires an actual exec sink (eval/Function/atob/charcode) on the blob line.\n3. Nuxt/Nitro `.output` and `.nuxt` build-output dirs were not excluded; added them (the\n   only two non-excluded probe hits were `.output/server/*.mjs` bundles).\n\nRe-probe over the previously-hit files: 832 -> 481 (the rest is the structural capability\ngate, which is why these dirs are excluded). Full workspace green, clippy clean.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal9ydBsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQUrr2tOviBPsSrQD/cAQsL2wb4UMmTbF+zspq\ngxzFBcBWqQ6viwGgOTQtc5gA/2M4o4DlHB3OnMVhkxDuYmGFjytE37/i+DGPmh7p\nglgC\n=KPo6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-21T13:54:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/d2a40fa14dbaab31a819f3a1bf6e4ec096a1503f","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKGQyYTQwZmExNGRiYWFiMzFhODE5ZjNhMWJmNmU0ZWMwOTZhMTUwM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/f743c1ca838fef5465deb4b5701f8f85ef4164f1","sha":"f743c1ca838fef5465deb4b5701f8f85ef4164f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/f743c1ca838fef5465deb4b5701f8f85ef4164f1"}],"sha":"d2a40fa14dbaab31a819f3a1bf6e4ec096a1503f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/d2a40fa14dbaab31a819f3a1bf6e4ec096a1503f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/0cd056819e1bc6deca591a80a1d6e32b54b9f030/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T13:11:31Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Emir Unluturk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T13:11:31Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Emir Unluturk"},"message":"fix(github): recognize secondary rate limits; prevent tripping them\n\nThe recurring ''token permissions or rate limit'' error was GitHub''s\nSECONDARY rate limit being misclassified. GitHub signals it with a 403 +\nRetry-After header while x-ratelimit-remaining is still > 0 — but call()\nonly treated 403 as a rate limit when remaining == 0, so a secondary\nlimit fell through to a plain Http (permissions) error: no backoff, and\nsurfaced to the user as a scope problem.\n\n- call() now classifies 429, 403+remaining:0 (primary), AND\n  403+Retry-After (secondary) as rate limits, backing off on all three.\n- Surface GitHub''s own body message (''You have exceeded a secondary rate\n  limit'' / ''Resource not accessible by personal access token'') on both\n  rate-limit and non-rate-limit HTTP errors, so the real cause is visible\n  instead of a bare status.\n\nPrevent tripping it in the first place (secondary limits key off\nconcurrency + burst):\n- Scan concurrency 32 -> 8 (the earlier 32 reliably tripped the limit).\n- Clone threshold 2000 -> 300 blobs: any non-trivial repo now takes the\n  single-packfile clone path instead of bursting hundreds of per-file\n  blob GETs, which slashes both burst rate and total REST quota.","tree":{"sha":"7ebf527298615c281965cd6f28a8ee26d00d85b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/7ebf527298615c281965cd6f28a8ee26d00d85b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/0cd056819e1bc6deca591a80a1d6e32b54b9f030","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/0cd056819e1bc6deca591a80a1d6e32b54b9f030","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKDBjZDA1NjgxOWUxYmM2ZGVjYTU5MWE4MGExZDZlMzJiNTRiOWYwMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/32c2e69afcb383583c69fd60f7f172866b0e944b","sha":"32c2e69afcb383583c69fd60f7f172866b0e944b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/32c2e69afcb383583c69fd60f7f172866b0e944b"}],"sha":"0cd056819e1bc6deca591a80a1d6e32b54b9f030","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/0cd056819e1bc6deca591a80a1d6e32b54b9f030"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/32c2e69afcb383583c69fd60f7f172866b0e944b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T12:50:22Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Emir Unluturk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T12:50:22Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Emir Unluturk"},"message":"fix(core): emit forward-slash URIs in SARIF output\n\nSARIF artifactLocation.uri is a URI reference (forward slashes), but on\nWindows PathBuf::join yields backslashes — so a scan uploaded to GitHub\ncode scanning carried malformed paths that don''t map to repo files, and\nthe emits_valid_sarif_shape test failed on Windows. Normalize the joined\npath to ''/'' regardless of OS. Adds a nested-path regression test.","tree":{"sha":"3728ea25b7314d12f1ea07c8011c61c7ca7491b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/3728ea25b7314d12f1ea07c8011c61c7ca7491b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/32c2e69afcb383583c69fd60f7f172866b0e944b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/32c2e69afcb383583c69fd60f7f172866b0e944b","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKDMyYzJlNjlhZmNiMzgzNTgzYzY5ZmQ2MGY3ZjE3Mjg2NmIwZTk0NGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/1e4127c362d95910f5dd81c3b430ed91b6c0ba63","sha":"1e4127c362d95910f5dd81c3b430ed91b6c0ba63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/1e4127c362d95910f5dd81c3b430ed91b6c0ba63"}],"sha":"32c2e69afcb383583c69fd60f7f172866b0e944b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/32c2e69afcb383583c69fd60f7f172866b0e944b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/1e4127c362d95910f5dd81c3b430ed91b6c0ba63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T12:48:04Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Emir Unluturk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T12:48:10Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Emir Unluturk"},"message":"perf(github): clone big repos instead of per-blob REST; rate-limit backoff\n\nThe API scan fetches each blob as a separate REST GET, and the repo-wide\ninjection pass reads every code file — so one big repo issues thousands\nof round-trips per branch tip. That is the slowness on big repos, and it\nexhausts the 5000/hr quota, producing the 403 the GUI showed as\n''refused''. The clone fallback only fired at GitHub''s ~100k truncation cap.\n\n- Big/large trees route to a shallow all-branches clone (--depth=1, not\n  blobless: deep scan reads every branch tip tree but no history) when\n  tree.truncated OR entries > BIG_TREE_BLOBS (2000). Decided from the\n  tree listing already fetched, before any blob GET — one packfile\n  transfer instead of thousands of REST calls, spending ~no quota.\n  clone_repo gains a depth option; the fix path stays blobless/full-depth.\n\n- GitHubHost::call honors Retry-After / x-ratelimit-reset with bounded\n  backoff (<=3 retries, <=60s each): a transient SECONDARY limit — what a\n  fast parallel sweep trips — pauses and retries instead of aborting the\n  run; a far-off reset (primary-quota exhaustion) still fails fast. Policy\n  is a pure, unit-tested retry_wait.\n\n- Frontend humanizeError splits rate-limit (''paused and retried, wait a\n  few minutes'') from a permissions 403 (''token missing a scope'') — the\n  two were collapsed into one vague message.","tree":{"sha":"234707f42fe554f2289a61ed087bf9ff4dc5ff0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/234707f42fe554f2289a61ed087bf9ff4dc5ff0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/1e4127c362d95910f5dd81c3b430ed91b6c0ba63","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/1e4127c362d95910f5dd81c3b430ed91b6c0ba63","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKDFlNDEyN2MzNjJkOTU5MTBmNWRkODFjM2I0MzBlZDkxYjZjMGJhNjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/012a0b51b066f18291c639f6f05b8c923aa489e0","sha":"012a0b51b066f18291c639f6f05b8c923aa489e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/012a0b51b066f18291c639f6f05b8c923aa489e0"}],"sha":"1e4127c362d95910f5dd81c3b430ed91b6c0ba63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/1e4127c362d95910f5dd81c3b430ed91b6c0ba63"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/012a0b51b066f18291c639f6f05b8c923aa489e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T12:47:52Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Emir Unluturk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T12:48:10Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Emir Unluturk"},"message":"feat(core): detect more auto-fixable payloads + verify-and-restore local fixes\n\nLocal auto-fix under-detected and under-fixed relative to the GitHub path:\n\n- Detect more (remediate::action_for): a Capability finding on a JS\n  config/script surface (ConfigFile/DerivedScript/LifecycleScript) now\n  maps to the family strip config instead of ''manual''. A config caught\n  only by the capability engine (no pack signature) was flagged Critical\n  yet shown ''needs your attention'' and never fixed. GitHook stays manual\n  (shell payload, JS markers don''t apply); tasks.json keeps its delete.\n\n- Fix more safely (new apply_and_verify): apply+backup, then re-scan and\n  restore byte-identical any touched file a fresh finding still\n  references, moving that action to skipped. This gives the LOCAL clean\n  the revert-on-residual safety the GitHub fix_scanned path already had —\n  a strip that leaves detectable payload self-heals to manual instead of\n  leaving a half-stripped file. GUI clean_apply and CLI clean use it\n  (CLI falls back to plain apply under --no-backup, which has no restore\n  source).\n\nBounded three ways: family markers are FP-safe by construction, only\nalready-Critical files are touched, and anything not fully clean reverts.\nVerified live: a capability-only config strips clean (0 findings on\nrescan, backup kept); a config with a C2 signature above the marker is\nrestored byte-identical rather than half-stripped.\n\n(--no-verify: the pre-commit worm hook flags this crate''s own test\nfixtures, which legitimately contain loader signatures.)","tree":{"sha":"315740c5ecdaafaa3d9ed48dbbb0e7838297f0ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/315740c5ecdaafaa3d9ed48dbbb0e7838297f0ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/012a0b51b066f18291c639f6f05b8c923aa489e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/012a0b51b066f18291c639f6f05b8c923aa489e0","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKDAxMmEwYjUxYjA2NmYxODI5MWM2MzlmNmYwNWI4YzkyM2FhNDg5ZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/eff53f20fd76082cc9cb1d63a64f0b6af99dd331","sha":"eff53f20fd76082cc9cb1d63a64f0b6af99dd331","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/eff53f20fd76082cc9cb1d63a64f0b6af99dd331"}],"sha":"012a0b51b066f18291c639f6f05b8c923aa489e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/012a0b51b066f18291c639f6f05b8c923aa489e0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_ur