 an absolute path to the built binary.\nAdded this to docs/mcp.md and the desktop MCP panel so the \"Executable not found\" error is\nself-explanatory. No code change.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal9ohhsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQUrr2tOviBPunmQEAjomzM6k5K6rPch+AVTKG\nRU+K924byxDzhd3hovZWxpQBANkr5ghnFMLz/DuQfaxkWlmd/UvFtVtFnFXIO3C+\ndVEI\n=c3y1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-21T13:54:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/f743c1ca838fef5465deb4b5701f8f85ef4164f1","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKGY3NDNjMWNhODM4ZmVmNTQ2NWRlYjRiNTcwMWY4Zjg1ZWY0MTY0ZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/eff53f20fd76082cc9cb1d63a64f0b6af99dd331","sha":"eff53f20fd76082cc9cb1d63a64f0b6af99dd331","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/eff53f20fd76082cc9cb1d63a64f0b6af99dd331"}],"sha":"f743c1ca838fe