sers/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/1405dd6171a93a7e5127c994c508325d06c806d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T11:45:39Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T11:45:39Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"message":"feat(desktop): surface pre-install check + IOC export in the GUI\n\nThe recent CLI capabilities (check-package, export-iocs) had no GUI surface; the new\ndetection signals already flow through the shared scan pipeline, so only these two needed\nwiring. Extracted the online package check into wormward_osm::check_npm_package (shared by\nthe CLI and the GUI so they never drift; httpmock-tested) and refactored the CLI to use it.\n\nDesktop:\n- Tauri commands `export_iocs(format)` and `check_package(name)`.\n- Advanced view: a \"Pre-install package check\" input (fetch metadata+entry, no execution ->\n  malicious/clean verdict) and an \"Export takedown IOCs\" panel (npm abuse report / STIX /\n  feed with copy).\n\n(hunt left CLI-only per plan — a research tool.) Tauri crate compiles; svelte-check 0/0 over\n147 files; full Rust workspace green; clippy clean.","tree":{"sha":"b2d6beb7453be3ece3a5547e0ec4eb4ffd1d828d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/b2d6beb7453be3ece3a5547e0ec4eb4ffd1d828d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/1405dd6171a93a7e5127c994c508325d06c806d6","verification":{"payload":"tree b2d6beb7453be3ece3a5547e0ec4eb4ffd1d828d\nparent b9180ea5a90919a82644501e03a0c575f4ab30f5\nauthor 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784634339 +0300\ncommitter 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784634339 +0300\n\nfeat(desktop): surface pre-install check + IOC export in the GUI\n\nThe recent CLI capabilities (check-package, export-iocs) had no GUI surface; the new\ndetection signals already flow through the shared scan pipeline, so only these two needed\nwiring. Extracted the online package check into wormward_osm::check_npm_package (shared by\nthe CLI and the GUI so they never drift; httpmock-tested) and refactored the CLI to use it.\n\nDesktop:\n- Tauri commands `export_iocs(format)` and `check_package(name)`.\n- Advanced view: a \"Pre-install package check\" input (fetch metadata+entry, no execution ->\n  malicious/clean verdict) and an \"Export takedown IOCs\" panel (npm abuse report / STIX /\n  feed with copy).\n\n(hunt left CLI-only per plan — a research tool.) Tauri crate compiles; svelte-check 0/0 over\n147 files; full Rust workspace green; clippy clean.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal9b4xsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQUrr2tOviBPvtgQD+L7lc02wSYSHHyuexZRxr\n+w9deVm+/E6mhgcMFWzNZNEBAOh91AMTefZ0JKoTBcPJt+nM6Xe6jG3fOOVgybv/\n56UF\n=sVJA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-21T12:35:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fa