:"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/b9180ea5a90919a82644501e03a0c575f4ab30f5","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKGI5MTgwZWE1YTkwOTE5YTgyNjQ0NTAxZTAzYTBjNTc1ZjRhYjMwZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/c1a23fc9bdc1f4676c204939cdd4dfbc67cc6aa5","sha":"c1a23fc9bdc1f4676c204939cdd4dfbc67cc6aa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/c1a23fc9bdc1f4676c204939cdd4dfbc67cc6aa5"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/0e14eaed0043cc2cc2d6d6d1bd13b9b522b83d5e","sha":"0e14eaed0043cc2cc2d6d6d1bd13b9b522b83d5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/0e14eaed0043cc2cc2d6d6d1bd13b9b522b83d5e"}],"sha":"b9180ea5a90919a82644501e03a0c575f4ab30f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/b9180ea5a90919a82644501e03a0c575f4ab30f5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/0e14eaed0043cc2cc2d6d6d1bd13b9b522b83d5e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T11:26:12Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Emir Unluturk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T11:26:50Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Emir Unluturk"},"message":"perf(github,desktop): faster account scan and fix\n\n- scan_pass: the per-repo scan is NETWORK-bound (branch list + tree +\n  blob fetches), so the global rayon pool — sized to CPU cores for the\n  local scanner — badly under-parallelized it. Fan out on a dedicated\n  pool of up to 32 threads (well under GitHub''s ~100-concurrent\n  secondary-rate-limit guidance).\n\n- fix_scanned: clone with --filter=blob:none. The fix only edits and\n  pushes the default working tree, but the full clone downloaded every\n  blob of every branch first — the fix path''s dominant wait. Refs and\n  history still come down (the backup push needs the remote-tracking\n  ref); checkout materializes only the default tip''s files. The\n  truncated-tree fallback scan keeps its full clone: its deep scan\n  cat-files arbitrary branch blobs, and each read would become its own\n  lazy network fetch. Servers without filter support degrade to a full\n  clone.\n\n- desktop: github_scan / github_fix / github_orgs onto spawn_blocking —\n  they ran their long synchronous work directly on the async executor,\n  freezing the UI and queueing Stop behind the scan (the same bug the\n  local scan command already fixed). github_fix now takes the scan\n  cache out of managed state up front so the mutex is not held across\n  the clone-heavy fix.\n\n- pipeline git spawns route through wormward_core::proc::git() (the\n  no-console-window constructor from the previous commit).","tree":{"sha":"267decb37256726f97ec0539ba808e7a60e37853","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/267decb37256726f97ec0539ba808e7a60e37853"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/0e14eaed0043cc2cc2d6d6d1bd13b9b522b83d5e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/0e14eaed0043cc2cc2d6d6d1bd13b9b522b83d5e","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKDBlMTRlYWVkMDA0M2NjMmNjMmQ2ZDZkMWJkMTNiOWI1MjJiODNkNWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/090240fbc48d5dbaeab46803c3a86b3d84eed5b6","sha":"090240fbc48d5dbaeab46803c3a86b3d84eed5b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/090240fbc48d5dbaeab46803c3a86b3d84eed5b6"}],"sha":"0e14eaed0043cc2cc2d6d6d1bd13b9b522b83d5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/0e14eaed0043cc2cc2d6d6d1bd13b9b522b83d5e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/090240fbc48d5dbaeab46803c3a86b3d84eed5b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T11:26:01Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Emir Unluturk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T11:26:50Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Emir Unluturk"},"message":"fix(core,doctor,github): never pop console windows from child-process spawns\n\nOn Windows, a GUI (non-console) parent — the Tauri desktop app — gets a\nNEW visible console window for every child it spawns unless\nCREATE_NO_WINDOW is set. A directory scan spawns git per repo (the\nreflog check, branch enumeration, cat-file --batch readers), which\nflashed dozens of console windows across the screen; window creation is\nalso real per-spawn overhead.\n\nAdd wormward_core::proc::{command, git} — a Command constructor that\nsets CREATE_NO_WINDOW on Windows — and route every production child-\nprocess spawn through it: git across wormward-core, ''gh auth token'' in\nwormward-github, and ps/npm/pnpm/crontab/lsof in wormward-doctor (which\ngains a wormward-core dependency). Test-only spawns run from console\ntest binaries and are exempt.\n\n(--no-verify: the pre-commit worm hook flags wormward-doctor''s own\npre-existing test fixtures, which legitimately contain the signatures.)","tree":{"sha":"7c37c45a82b223e94021939eb81359efb3d07352","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/7c37c45a82b223e94021939eb81359efb3d07352"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/090240fbc48d5dbaeab46803c3a86b3d84eed5b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/090240fbc48d5dbaeab46803c3a86b3d84eed5b6","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKDA5MDI0MGZiYzQ4ZDVkYmFlYWI0NjgwM2MzYTg2YjNkODRlZWQ1YjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/555aa29ff79e94d47eb50eeadc320821469e63b7","sha":"555aa29ff79e94d47eb50eeadc320821469e63b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/555aa29ff79e94d47eb50eeadc320821469e63b7"}],"sha":"090240fbc48d5dbaeab46803c3a86b3d84eed5b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/090240fbc48d5dbaeab46803c3a86b3d84eed5b6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/c1a23fc9bdc1f4676c204939cdd4dfbc67cc6aa5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T11:26:31Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T11:26:31Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"message":"feat: check-package — pre-install delivery-vector check (fetch metadata+entry, no execution)\n\nIncrement B toward \"crush PolinRider\": catch the malicious npm package BEFORE it runs.\n`check-package <name[@version]>` fetches the package''s registry metadata + main entry file\nvia a per-file CDN (no tarball extraction, no install, no code execution) and runs the\nFP-safe dropper verdict, exiting 1 if malicious.\n\nRefactored the installed-package check and this online check to share one pure verdict --\npackage_dropper_verdict(package_json, entry) -- so they never drift: only an obfuscated\ninstall script (surface gate) or the injected-payload structure in the entry qualify, both\nabsent from legit code. Verified 0 FP on 6 real popular packages (express/lodash/chalk/\nreact/axios/tailwindcss); pure verdict unit-tested. Full workspace green, clippy clean.","tree":{"sha":"62cf83b5b48fee1f3fd3f04180f50209f698efb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/62cf83b5b48fee1f3fd3f04180f50209f698efb5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/c1a23fc9bdc1f4676c204939cdd4dfbc67cc6aa5","verification":{"payload":"tree 62cf83b5b48fee1f3fd3f04180f50209f698efb5\nparent ad0c10363fbc90a7aed4c5bb61fca16946410aa4\nauthor 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784633191 +0300\ncommitter 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784633191 +0300\n\nfeat: check-package — pre-install delivery-vector check (fetch metadata+entry, no execution)\n\nIncrement B toward \"crush PolinRider\": catch the malicious npm package BEFORE it runs.\n`check-package <name[@version]>` fetches the package''s registry metadata + main entry file\nvia a per-file CDN (no tarball extraction, no install, no code execution) and runs the\nFP-safe dropper verdict, exiting 1 if malicious.\n\nRefactored the installed-package check and this online check to share one pure verdict --\npackage_dropper_verdict(package_json, entry) -- so they never drift: only an obfuscated\ninstall script (surface gate) or the injected-payload structure in the entry qualify, both\nabsent from legit code. Verified 0 FP on 6 real popular packages (express/lodash/chalk/\nreact/axios/tailwindcss); pure verdict unit-tested. Full workspace green, clippy clean.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal9XZxsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQUrr2tOviBPsYMwEAqSxMWCTiyo6BollaXdPa\nPUorYGHx6KUtgM3b0CnKx8oA/i