it fires on a final physical line that is a dramatic\nlength outlier (>=400 chars and >=4x the median readable-code line) carrying an\nexecution/obfuscation token (eval/Function/atob/charcode or a large inline string-array)\n-- a giant obfuscated statement grafted onto an otherwise-normal file. Folded into\ninjected_payload, so the repo-wide pass, the package behavioural check, and the analyzer\nall gain it.\n\nFP-safety: requires the HEAD to be readable source (>=3 short, non-comment code lines),\nso a minified/production bundle (license header + one giant line) never fires. Validated\nagainst real packages -- an initial version FP''d three.min.js/vue.prod.js; the readable-head\nguard fixed it, locked by a regression test. 0 FP across 24 real popular packages (minified,\nproduction, obfuscated). Purely additive: full workspace green (0 regressions), clippy clean.","tree":{"sha":"3b5309b05486d6160a43889429b11d4e68195863","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/3b5309b05486d6160a43889429b11d4e68195863"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/d81230b148ff3281dc7587457b42ed99c4da7be2","verification":{"payload":"tree 3b5309b05486d6160a43889429b11d4e68195863\nparent 555aa29ff79e94d47eb50eeadc320821469e63b7\nauthor 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784632287 +0300\ncommitter 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784632287 +0300\n\nfeat(core): evasion resistance — appended-obfuscated-blob detector (name/version-independent)\n\nIncrement A toward \"crush PolinRider\". The structural tells (>=200-space padding,\n_$_hex decoder) are version-independent but still key on this family''s current shape;\na determined operator could drop the padding and rename the decoder. appended_obfuscated_blob\ncloses that name-independently: it fires on a final physical line that is a dramatic\nlength outlier (>=400 chars and >=4x the median readable-code line) carrying an\nexecution/obfuscation token (eval/Function/atob/charcode or a large inline string-array)\n-- a giant obfuscated statement grafted onto an otherwise-normal file. Folded into\ninjected_payload, so the repo-wide pass, the package behavioural check, and the analyzer\nall gain it.\n\nFP-safety: requires the HEAD to be readable source (>=3 short, non-comment code lines),\nso a minified/production bundle (license header + one giant line) never fires. Validated\nagainst real packages -- an initial version FP''d three.min.js/vue.prod.js; the readable-head\nguard fixed it, locked by a regression test. 0 FP across 24 real popular packages (minified,\nproduction, obfuscated). Purely additive: full workspace green (0 regressions), clippy clean.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal9T3xsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQUrr2tOviBPtzGgEAwQmAPZR+8QztcThGLsGZ\nDh83hgIEugYR7o9dtoZF4NYA/R+TdYPkKOzM0FvLKTyUtXdOIs5Wqj+kRa3L4Y/X\n+AcO\n=+vtt\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-21T11:30:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/