er","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/555aa29ff79e94d47eb50eeadc320821469e63b7","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKDU1NWFhMjlmZjc5ZTk0ZDQ3ZWI1MGVlYWRjMzIwODIxNDY5ZTYzYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/b1c9d312b5acebef5c56ac5e4d63fc91c5bd2469","sha":"b1c9d312b5acebef5c56ac5e4d63fc91c5bd2469","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/b1c9d312b5acebef5c56ac5e4d63fc91c5bd2469"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/727759a3dc0cc55673ed6cfee46ddbdc769418a5","sha":"727759a3dc0cc55673ed6cfee46ddbdc769418a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/727759a3dc0cc55673ed6cfee46ddbdc769418a5"}],"sha":"555aa29ff79e94d47eb50eeadc320821469e63b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/555aa29ff79e94d47eb50eeadc320821469e63b7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/b1c9d312b5acebef5c56ac5e4d63fc91c5bd2469/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T10:52:41Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T10:52:41Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"message":"feat(core): delivery-vector detection — dependency-name typosquats (behaviour-corroborated)\n\nFirst increment toward crushing the PolinRider DELIVERY vector (catch the malicious\nnpm package, not just the post-run injection). A dependency whose name resembles a\npopular package is flagged ONLY when FP-safe:\n\n- misspelling (edit/transposition distance 1) of a popular name -> suppressed\n  community lead (pkg-community: id, off unless --include-community);\n- decoration (<root>-<word>) -> NEVER a name-only finding; fires as a visible Medium\n  ONLY when the installed package also shows dropper behaviour (injected-payload\n  structure or a malicious install script — both absent from legit code);\n- names already tracked by a pack are skipped, so the pass is purely additive and\n  never overrides a version pin (fixes the regression it would otherwise cause).\n\nFP-safety proven by auditing the matcher against 3,366 real npm names from the live\nregistry across the worst-case ecosystems. This caught and fixed a real FP class\n(react/next/vite/eslint plugin ecosystems: react-icons, lucide-react, ...) and locked\nthe rest in with real_legit_lookalikes_installed_clean_produce_no_findings, which\ninstalls ~18 real look-alikes (chalk-cli, prettier-plugin-tailwindcss, tailwindcss-*)\nclean and asserts zero findings — the behaviour gate, not the name, is the sole\ndiscriminator.\n\nPurely additive: full workspace green (0 regressions), core+packs clippy clean.","tree":{"sha":"21c0bc958e130a6bee0e89f3fc0f73f2b61545f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/21c0bc958e130a6bee0e89f3fc0f73f2b61545f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/b1c9d312b5acebef5c56ac5e4d63fc91c5bd2469","verification":{"payload":"tree 21c0bc958e130a6bee0e89f3fc0f73f2b61545f3\nparent 770ce9b6f2fa8b2dd00e3f463d7cc0f91677b74c\nauthor 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784631161 +0300\ncommitter 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784631161 +0300\n\nfeat(core): delivery-vector detection — dependency-name typosquats (behaviour-corroborated)\n\nFirst increment toward crushing the PolinRider DELIVERY vector (catch the malicious\nnpm package, not just the post-run injection). A dependency whose name resembles a\npopular package is flagged ONLY when FP-safe:\n\n- misspelling (edit/transposition distance 1) of a popular name -> suppressed\n  community lead (pkg-community: id, off unless --include-community);\n- decoration (<root>-<word>) -> NEVER a name-only finding; fires as a visible Medium\n  ONLY when the installed package also shows dropper behaviour (injected-payload\n  structure or a malicious install script — both absent from legit code);\n- names already tracked by a pack are skipped, so the pass is purely additive and\n  never overrides a version pin (fixes the regression it would otherwise cause).\n\nFP-safety proven by auditing the matcher against 3,366 real npm names from the live\nregistry across the worst-case ecosystems. This caught and fixed a real FP class\n(react/next/vite/eslint plugin ecosystems: react-icons, lucide-react, ...) and locked\nthe rest in with real_legit_lookalikes_installed_clean_produce_no_findings, which\ninstalls ~18 real look-alikes (chalk-cli, prettier-plugin-tailwindcss, tailwindcss-*)\nclean and asserts zero findings — the behaviour gate, not the name, is the sole\ndiscriminator.\n\nPurely additive: full workspace green (0 regressions), core+packs clippy clean.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal9PeRsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQUrr2tOviBPvphgD+L5HaklomQHz2Eoqr4ENe\n0Bqn7sPp72yRV9PWRlV3bxcBANYLSgkBvdYrpL/bZKqY8ESWK2Y24g2qcchKIeHw\nCpoC\n=ia9B\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-21T11:01:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/b1c9d312b5acebef5c56ac5e4d63fc91c5bd2469","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKGIxYzlkMzEyYjVhY2ViZWY1YzU2YWM1ZTRkNjNmYzkxYzViZDI0Njk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/770ce9b6f2fa8b2dd00e3f463d7cc0f91677b74c","sha":"770ce9b6f2fa8b2dd00e3f463d7cc0f91677b74c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/770ce9b6f2fa8b2dd00e3f463d7cc0f91677b74c"}],"sha":"b1c9d312b5acebef5c56ac5e4d63fc91c5bd2469","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/b1c9d312b5acebef5c56ac5e4d63fc91c5bd2469"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/770ce9b6f2fa8b2dd00e3f463d7cc0f91677b74c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T10:50:49Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T10:50:49Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"message":"fix(core): padding-injection no longer false-positives on wide markdown tables\n\nline_has_padding_run flagged any ''<content><200+ space pad><content>'' line as the\nPolinRider code<pad>payload shape. Wide markdown tables hit that exactly: a short\ncell padded to align the next column ends ''<cell><600 spaces>|'', so README/.mdx\ndocs (bun-types, zod-to-json-schema, enquirer, @sinonjs/fake-timers) in the npx/TS\ncaches were reported as ''Infected app caches''. The injection''s payload is obfuscated\ncode (global.x=…;var _$_hex=eval(…)), never a ''|'' column delimiter — so ignore a\nrun whose closing byte is ''|''. Real injections still fire (payload after the pad is\nnot ''|''); adds a regression test. wormward-core 190/190.","tree":{"sha":"ea0a2e637171d4f98a346b642b6d9ac7c0c3f1ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/ea0a2e637171d4f98a346b642b6d9ac7c0c3f1ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/770ce9b6f2fa8b2dd00e3f463d7cc0f91677b74c","verification":{"payload":"tree ea0a2e637171d4f98a346b642b6d9ac7c0c3f1ce\nparent 2133837e8e6762367a9947183574bbdae18e0edd\nauthor 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784631049 +0300\ncommitter 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784631049 +0300\n\nfix(core): padding-injection no longer false-positives on wide markdown tables\n\nline_has_padding_run flagged any ''<content><200+ space pad><content>'' line as the\nPolinRider code<pad>payload shape. Wide markdown tables hit that exactly: a short\ncell padded to align the next column ends ''<cell><600 spaces>|'', so README/.mdx\ndocs (bun-types, zod-to-json-schema, enquirer, @sinonjs/fake-timers) in the npx/TS\ncaches were reported as ''Infected app caches''. The injection''s payload is obfuscated\ncode (global.x=…;var _$_hex=eval(…)), never a ''|'' column delimiter — so ignore a\nrun whose closing byte is ''|''. Real injections still fire (payload after the pad is\nnot ''|''); adds a regression test. wormward-core 190/190.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal9PCRsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQUrr2tOviBPv1/gEA3s22OVx1nyHkfBB4N7hN\ndo6IoX27ZabDPOx5KzDiVIgBAIz1OW67TGUZEuXQFik6isafSaX9jA/u/8RKkaLq\nxukO\n=EQ2F\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-21T11:01:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/770ce9b6f2fa8b2dd00e3f463d7cc0f91677b74c","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKDc3MGNlOWI2ZjJmYThiMmRkMDBlM2Y0NjNkN2NjMGY5MTY3N2I3NGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/2133837e8e6762367a9947183574bbdae18e0edd","sha":"2133837e8e6762367a9947183574bbdae18e0edd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/2133837e8e6762367a9947183574bbdae18e0edd"}],"sha":"770ce9b6f2fa8b2dd00e3f463d7cc0f91677b74c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/770ce9b6f2fa8b2dd00e3f463d7cc0f91677b74c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/2133837e8e6762367a9947183574bbdae18e0edd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T10:35:42Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T10:35:42Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"message":"feat: Windows machine check (processes/caches/triggers) + enable it in the GUI\n\nThe doctor was macOS-only (ps + ~/Library caches + launchd), so on Windows it found\nnothing and the GUI showed a false clean / ''macOS-only''. Add #[cfg(target_os=windows)]\nbranches: list_processes via a PowerShell CIM query (pid + full command line),\ncache_targets from %APPDATA%/%LOCALAPPDATA% (npx cache, global npm/pnpm, TS ATA),\nand home_dir falls back to USERPROFILE. npm ignore-scripts triggers already work\ncross-platform. Enable machineSupported for Windows; Linux/other still show an honest\n''not available yet''. Cross-compile-checked for x86_64-pc-windows-gnu; macOS 23/23.\n\nNOTE: compile-verified only — the Windows detection paths/commands still need a real\nWindows run to confirm.","tree":{"sha":"0267cad55b90114588c21f373e70c5b0f6310f90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/0267cad55b90114588c21f373e70c5b0f6310f90"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/2133837e8e6762367a9947183574bbdae18e0edd","verification":{"payload":"tree 0267cad55b90114588c21f373e70c5b0f6310f90\nparent 815c88be784d488124d12799c5a0cac07f7abb88\nauthor 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784630142 +0300\ncommitter 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784630142 +0300\n\nfeat: Windows machine check (processes/caches/triggers) + enable it in the GUI\n\nThe doctor was macOS-only (ps + ~/Library caches + launchd), so on Windows it found\nnothing and the GUI showed a false clean / ''macOS-only''. Add #[cfg(target_os=windows)]\nbranches: list_processes via a PowerShell CIM query (pid + full command line),\ncache_targets from %APPDATA%/%LOCALAPPDATA% (npx cache, global npm/pnpm, TS ATA),\nand home_dir falls back to USERPROFILE. npm ignore-scripts triggers already work\ncross-platform. Enable machineSupported for Windows; Linux/other still show an honest\n''not available yet''. Cross-compile-checked for x86_64-pc-windows-gnu; macOS 23/23.\n\nNOTE: compile-verified only — the Windows detection paths/commands still need a real\nWindows run to confirm.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal9LfhsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQUrr2tOviBPskqQEA/eCeSyAA1Hti+C8HZuua\n+I1ThQ+vCqfRTujRwnb7KpEA/jjbky4S7HLMif2aE5ewqQmUwCbuZVIl6+FCaoN/\npTMH\n=GFCV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-21T11:01:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/2133837e8e6762367a9947183574bbdae18e0edd","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKDIxMzM4MzdlOGU2NzYyMzY3YTk5NDcxODM1NzRiYmRhZTE4ZTBlZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/815c88be784d488124d12799c5a0cac07f7abb88","sha":"815c88be784d488124d12799c5a0cac07f7abb88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/815c88be784d488124d12799c5a0cac07f7abb88"}],"sha":"2133837e8e6762367a9947183574bbdae18e0edd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/2133837e8e6762367a9947183574bbdae18e0edd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/727759a3dc0cc55673ed6cfee46ddbdc769418a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T10:11:23Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Emir Unluturk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T10:11:39Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Emir Unluturk"},"message":"perf(cli,desktop): parallelize clean''s re-scans; unpin the async executor\n\nThe removal flow re-scanned every repo sequentially while scan itself\nfans out with rayon — so a clean took a multiple of the scan the user\nhad just watched, twice over in the GUI (clean_preview, then\nclean_apply re-scanning a third time).\n\n- CLI clean: discover once across dirs (deduped), scan repos via\n  par_iter like scan does; output sorted so plans and prompts stay\n  deterministic.\n- Desktop clean_preview / clean_apply / clean_branches_preview /\n  clean_branches_apply / restore: same rayon fan-out, and all moved\n  onto spawn_blocking so the sync scan loop no longer pins the async\n  executor (which also froze the UI during cleans).\n\nclean_apply keeps its freshness re-scan before writing (the tree may\nhave changed since the preview) — now parallel and scoped to the\nselected repos.\n\nWhole-tree clean dry-run: 26s -> 7.0s.","tree":{"sha":"21ea4685f6a132ebd22fa1a789a134f2a683bf86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/21ea4685f6a132ebd22fa1a789a134f2a683bf86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/727759a3dc0cc55673ed6cfee46ddbdc769418a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/727759a3dc0cc55673ed6cfee46ddbdc769418a5","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKDcyNzc1OWEzZGMwY2M1NTY3M2VkNmNmZWU0NmRkYmRjNzY5NDE4YTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/c5657f2c19688476f923f81f89e66fef36ccb63e","sha":"c5657f2c19688476f923f81f89e66fef36ccb63e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/c5657f2c19688476f923f81f89e66fef36ccb63e"}],"sha":"727759a3dc0cc55673ed6cfee46ddbdc769418a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/727759a3dc0cc55673ed6cfee46ddbdc769418a5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/c5657f2c19688476f923f81f89e66fef36ccb63e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T10:11:14Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Emir Unluturk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T10:11:38Z","email":"emunluturk@gmail.com","name":"Emir Unluturk"},"message":"perf(core): stop walking build outputs and node_modules package internals\n\nTwo walk-level fixes measured on a real 112-repo tree (~412k files):\n\n- walk_repo_files now prunes EXCLUDED_DIRS (target/, dist/, .next/, ...)\n  at walk time — every scan pass already discarded those paths via\n  is_excluded_path, so enumerating them (99% of walked paths on a Rust\n  repo) was pure wasted I/O. The list is shared with surface.rs so the\n  walk prune and the per-path check (still applied to GitTree paths)\n  can never drift.\n\n- discover_repos descends into node_modules package-shaped: only\n  package roots (<pkg>, @scope/<pkg>, .pnpm/<name>@<ver>), nested\n  node_modules, and .git are entered — never a package''s internal file\n  tree. Discovery was 14.4s of a 26s scan; now near-zero. The worm\n  vendors at node_modules/<pkg>/.git, so coverage is unchanged where it\n  matters; a .git buried inside a package''s shipped sources is the\n  documented, tested tradeoff.\n\nWhole-tree scan: 26s -> 8.7s, with byte-identical findings.","tree":{"sha":"6540e272376fa6d5f9ea2184a6ce051d4413bf6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/6540e272376fa6d5f9ea2184a6ce051d4413bf6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/c5657f2c19688476f923f81f89e66fef36ccb63e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3386313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mehmetunlt","id":3386313,"login":"mehmetunlt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODYzMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehmetunlt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/c5657f2c19688476f923f81f89e66fef36ccb63e","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKGM1NjU3ZjJjMTk2ODg0NzZmOTIzZjgxZjg5ZTY2ZmVmMzZjY2I2M2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/815c88be784d488124d12799c5a0cac07f7abb88","sha":"815c88be784d488124d12799c5a0cac07f7abb88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/815c88be784d488124d12799c5a0cac07f7abb88"}],"sha":"c5657f2c19688476f923f81f89e66fef36ccb63e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/c5657f2c19688476f923f81f89e66fef36ccb63e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/815c88be784d488124d12799c5a0cac07f7abb88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T09:44:24Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T09:44:24Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"message":"feat(desktop): platform-aware machine surface (This Mac/PC/computer, macOS-only check)\n\nThe UI hardcoded \"This Mac\" and the machine check (ps + macOS caches + launchd\ntriggers) is macOS-only — on Windows/Linux it found nothing and read as a false\n\"no threats\". Add lib/platform.ts (UA-based os + device noun + machineSupported);\nuse the platform noun everywhere (\"This Mac\"/\"This PC\"/\"This computer\"), and off\nmacOS: force scanMac off, hide the machine surface toggle, and show an honest\n\"Machine check is macOS-only for now\" instead of a false clean. Code scanning is\ncross-platform and unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"aed538899537d2fa65050b3fb29ca05515315e84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/aed538899537d2fa65050b3fb29ca05515315e84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/815c88be784d488124d12799c5a0cac07f7abb88","verification":{"payload":"tree aed538899537d2fa65050b3fb29ca05515315e84\nparent 6b1ecaf7ed70a03db9a412a4d45a8d52b563ddeb\nauthor 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784627064 +0300\ncommitter 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784627064 +0300\n\nfeat(desktop): platform-aware machine surface (This Mac/PC/computer, macOS-only check)\n\nThe UI hardcoded \"This Mac\" and the machine check (ps + macOS caches + launchd\ntriggers) is macOS-only — on Windows/Linux it found nothing and read as a false\n\"no threats\". Add lib/platform.ts (UA-based os + device noun + machineSupported);\nuse the platform noun everywhere (\"This Mac\"/\"This PC\"/\"This computer\"), and off\nmacOS: force scanMac off, hide the machine surface toggle, and show an honest\n\"Machine check is macOS-only for now\" instead of a false clean. Code scanning is\ncross-platform and unchanged.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal8/eBsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQUrr2tOviBPtdXwD/UWPn0nsWQqpNtAdLeZ/r\n8N2LDmtz4c2wajtIZtsUTc4BAPzhTJU8bt8TLQQm5WYCVZh23BfMV7Fs579ammxW\neWME\n=6H/f\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-21T09:45:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/815c88be784d488124d12799c5a0cac07f7abb88","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKDgxNWM4OGJlNzg0ZDQ4ODEyNGQxMjc5OWM1YTBjYWMwN2Y3YWJiODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/6b1ecaf7ed70a03db9a412a4d45a8d52b563ddeb","sha":"6b1ecaf7ed70a03db9a412a4d45a8d52b563ddeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyi