nate — dozens of prefixes). Noted as a lower bound (GitHub caps at 1,000/query;\nthe densest decoder buckets still exceed it).","tree":{"sha":"f2aeeffd84151cda665a4005ceb5d6776eaa73da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/f2aeeffd84151cda665a4005ceb5d6776eaa73da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/6b1ecaf7ed70a03db9a412a4d45a8d52b563ddeb","verification":{"payload":"tree f2aeeffd84151cda665a4005ceb5d6776eaa73da\nparent cafa2109308e8c3d022affa4738f83d0878a7b0c\nauthor 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784626144 +0300\ncommitter 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784626144 +0300\n\ndocs(readme): expand PolinRider corpus to full sweep — 2,471 confirmed infected\n\nPartitioned the dominant `_$_1e42` decoder by extension+size to beat GitHub''s\n1,000-results/query cap and paginated every seed to full depth. Candidate repos\n1,124 -> 3,239; confirmed infected 762 -> 2,471 (2,193 by scan, 278 dropper-only).\nVersion-tag families reconfirm the rotation (5-3-* is a small minority; 8-*/9-*/10-*\ndominate — dozens of prefixes). Noted as a lower bound (GitHub caps at 1,000/query;\nthe densest decoder buckets still exceed it).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal874BsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQUrr2tOviBPtuSgD/bGomccTFkk+y2yVXq0we\nIryVDOEuIal7Q+YD2t+OokMBAJmb8eJAZm/Vq01ZmV8kjB6RROFCMiJFcnsShpnr\nTbMP\n=txon\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-21T09:31:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.co