","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T20:24:19Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"message":"fix(core): exclude bun/yarn package caches from content scanning (kill @babel/node-fetch FP)\n\n.bun/install/cache/ (and .yarn/cache, .yarn/unplugged) are content-addressed blob\ncaches like the pnpm store / npm _cacache — not install trees. Legit library\nbundles there (@babel/parser, node-fetch) tripped the capability engine\n(regex .exec() read as process-spawn, HTTP lib network-egress, bundle exports as\ntrailing-code). Both scan passes honor is_excluded_path, so this suppresses it.","tree":{"sha":"9171b1aab8f006b876549eb3e1130442b523870a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/9171b1aab8f006b876549eb3e1130442b523870a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/ac374b838496c7022f0bbd903272f82689423e9b","verification":{"payload":"tree 9171b1aab8f006b876549eb3e1130442b523870a\nparent d57d9a1da9c4c16a0cfc61ebbb21bc0ce72ab070\nauthor 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784579059 +0300\ncommitter 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784579059 +0300\n\nfix(core): exclude bun/yarn package caches from content scanning (kill @babel/node-fetch FP)\n\n.bun/install/cache/ (and .yarn/cache, .yarn/unplugged) are content-addressed blob\ncaches like the pnpm store / npm _cacache — not install trees. Legit library\nbundles there (@babel/parser, node-fetch) tripped the capability engine\n(regex .exec() read as process-spawn, HTTP lib network-egress, bundle exports as\ntrailing-code). Both scan passes honor is_excluded_path, so this suppresses it.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal6D8xsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQUrr2tOviBPsrEwEAv9A0HimZadgKeRWDrMK0\nWNKli6JFn3lKwbBV5864ra8A/isLYaB6fV43EzDMqH3mBMuul19pNz2snnLUrbMp\nAsAJ\n=mU+s\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":tr