d03d66ea0c49ca06783752fa80e02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T18:50:53Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T18:50:53Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"message":"fix(doctor): correlate keychain-theft with a loader process (kill git-credential FP)\n\nReading the GitHub keychain credential is also what git''s osxkeychain flow, gh,\neditors, and keychain-sync do — a bare `security find-internet-password …github`\nfired on every `git push` (a live FP). Now reported only when a confirmed loader\nprocess is ALSO present (scan_keychain_correlated), never on its own.","tree":{"sha":"c57981b88fb771d748f5c669ba5dace340984f7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/c57981b88fb771d748f5c669ba5dace340984f7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/b2b2d496383d03d66ea0c49ca06783752fa80e02","verification":{"payload":"tree c57981b88fb771d748f5c669ba5dace340984f7f\nparent 10324a01f3e08a25cf721079d5473f4ddb3aa984\nauthor 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784573453 +0300\ncommitter 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784573453 +0300\n\nfix(doctor): correlate keychain-theft with a loader process (kill git-credential FP)\n\nReading the GitHub keychain credential is also what git''s osxkeychain flow, gh,\neditors, and keychain-sync do — a bare `security find-internet-password …github`\nfired on every `git push` (a live FP). Now reported only when a confirmed loader\nprocess is ALSO present (scan_keychain_correlated), never on its own.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal5uDRsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQUrr2tOviBPvooQEAglzcnpo7EmFTVJE+3nNR\njsoctD8j6T22PjCn0FWvnSAA/jV0H1lTTL0sJFP5w7fVqL2Pm+bgIGw5c9hWOSET\nouwF\n=jSHC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-20T18:50:55Z"}},"committer