e-click clean shouldn''t be offered on partial data\nanyway); Stop now drops straight to the partial results.","tree":{"sha":"105b385203db457b54a6a1dec70b35574d6914b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/105b385203db457b54a6a1dec70b35574d6914b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/289f1c06ae2cd03dfdae1a78fb2a15623c2bc4e0","verification":{"payload":"tree 105b385203db457b54a6a1dec70b35574d6914b5\nparent abb818bd9fc1d9a0f736cc3fd7c25b57eb62b299\nauthor 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784569743 +0300\ncommitter 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784569743 +0300\n\nfix(desktop): Stop returns to partial results at once (skip clean-preview on cancel)\n\nStop signalled cancel correctly, but runScan then always called cleanPreview,\nwhich re-scans every repo uncancellably (discover_repos + scan_repo per repo).\nSo after Stop the app immediately ground through a full second scan with\n\"Stopping…\" stuck on screen — looking broken. Skip the remediation preview on\na cancelled/partial scan (a one-click clean shouldn''t be offered on partial data\nanyway); Stop now drops straight to the partial results.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal5fjxsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQUrr2tOviBPtCiwEAyWIktOZcgHnKruPR+ZZU\nj/U/huhrLGZY9O1sQZ+uE7ABANZObRW0LkCDkd/coKxln+yTug+OCRlnqmSnXM96\nxlcO\n=lnVV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-20T17:54:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id"