_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/abb818bd9fc1d9a0f736cc3fd7c25b57eb62b299/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T17:24:51Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T17:24:51Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"message":"docs(spec): wormward FP-hardening — three false-positive classes + defenses\n\nConsolidates the lockfile/CAS-metadata, base64/WASM-glue short-literal, and\nbare-literal/number FP classes: evidence (yarn.lock, @rive-app WASM glue), root\ncause, defense applied (hard veto, seed proximity, identifier-context decoder,\nsurface exclusions, confidence tiering, magic-byte + Unicode-run guards), and\nthe regression test locking each. Ends with a checklist for adding new signatures\nwithout re-introducing FPs.","tree":{"sha":"3afb0687221f0c2ec0aa38223a34aea06ba55c7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/3afb0687221f0c2ec0aa38223a34aea06ba55c7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/abb818bd9fc1d9a0f736cc3fd7c25b57eb62b299","verification":{"payload":"tree 3afb0687221f0c2ec0aa38223a34aea06ba55c7d\nparent b53c9cf7f46ae1f0ead5c43099a430bf8caaa78c\nauthor 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784568291 +0300\ncommitter 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784568291 +0300\n\ndocs(spec): wormward FP-hardening — three false-positive classes + defenses\n\nConsolidates the lockfile/CAS-metadata, base64/WASM-glue short-literal, and\nbare-literal/number FP classes: evidence (yarn.lock, @rive-app WASM glue), root\ncause, defense applied (hard veto, seed proximity, identifier-context decoder,\nsurface exclusions, confidence tiering, magic-byte + Unicode-run guards), and\nthe regression test locking each. Ends with a checklist for adding new signatures\nwithout re-introducing FPs.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal5Z4xsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQUrr2tOviBPtK+AD/dK0qV5V6zxi7fhg6hA1K\nAREp0OOVTYeI/BCozDvrO5UBALbE7mhwQF0+ODtKourVdBrUD/n3GY3w79GHP/EW\nS3EF\n=4t+/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-20T17:24:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/abb818bd9fc1d9a0f736cc3fd7c25b57eb62b299","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKGFiYjgxOGJkOWZjMWQ5YTBmNzM2Y2MzZmQ3YzI1YjU3ZWI2MmIyOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/b53c9cf7f46ae1f0ead5c43099a430bf8caaa78c","sha":"b53c9cf7f46ae1f0ead5c43099a430bf8caaa78c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/b53c9cf7f46ae1f0ead5c43099a430bf8caaa78c"}],"sha":"abb818bd9fc1d9a0f736cc3fd7c25b57eb62b299","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/abb818bd9fc1d9a0f736cc3fd7c25b57eb62b299"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/b53c9cf7f46ae1f0ead5c43099a430bf8caaa78c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T17:21:04Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T17:21:04Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"message":"fix(packs): match MDy decoder as a definition, not a bare substring (kills WASM-glue FP)\n\n''MDy'' is three base64-alphabet chars, so content.contains(\"MDy\") false-positived\ninside base64/WASM-glue blobs — e.g. @rive-app/canvas-advanced-single''s Emscripten\noutput (...ApMDyAL...) flagged Critical/confirmed on EVERY project using Rive.\n\nNow the decoder is matched only as a DEFINED identifier: \\bfunction MDy(\\b,\n\\b(var|let|const) MDy=\\b, or the base64-safe \\b_$_[0-9a-f]{4,}\\b family name.\nBare MDy in encoded data never confirms; real v2 (function/var MDy definition)\nstill does. Verified: real Mirage repo scans clean (0 findings).","tree":{"sha":"5a8e8cf51a03c1d66702a909d8166596d9ffe9e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/5a8e8cf51a03c1d66702a909d8166596d9ffe9e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/b53c9cf7f46ae1f0ead5c43099a430bf8caaa78c","verification":{"payload":"tree 5a8e8cf51a03c1d66702a909d8166596d9ffe9e7\nparent edd11e53b60f93f4a9abf080c3ed3dfc66fcedb8\nauthor 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784568064 +0300\ncommitter 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784568064 +0300\n\nfix(packs): match MDy decoder as a definition, not a bare substring (kills WASM-glue FP)\n\n''MDy'' is three base64-alphabet chars, so content.contains(\"MDy\") false-positived\ninside base64/WASM-glue blobs — e.g. @rive-app/canvas-advanced-single''s Emscripten\noutput (...ApMDyAL...) flagged Critical/confirmed on EVERY project using Rive.\n\nNow the decoder is matched only as a DEFINED identifier: \\bfunction MDy(\\b,\n\\b(var|let|const) MDy=\\b, or the base64-safe \\b_$_[0-9a-f]{4,}\\b family name.\nBare MDy in encoded data never confirms; real v2 (function/var MDy definition)\nstill does. Verified: real Mirage repo scans clean (0 findings).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal5ZABsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQUrr2tOviBPtYKQD8C862LltN/YJeA0CSsH2W\nbTMDI8fckxjWlJ1BrjIYwAwA/1MAgGW7scNoPLTRatrEhvPqtuMzM3gjNhMztSQw\nHNoK\n=43ys\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-20T17:21:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_