sers/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/edd11e53b60f93f4a9abf080c3ed3dfc66fcedb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T17:06:43Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T17:06:43Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"message":"fix(desktop): scan-flow layout — log fills its area, no growing scroll/gap\n\nThe scanning step was top-aligned inside a min-height-viewport main, so the\ncapped log left a tall empty tail (a scroll gap under Show details), and while\nthe log streamed it grew the page scroll. Now the flow fills the view and\ncenters short steps (safe-center, so long results still top-align + scroll),\nand the scanning step''s open log flexes to fill the leftover height and scrolls\nINTERNALLY — the streaming log never grows the page, leaves no gap, and doesn''t\nreflow. Closed log: status is centered, stable during the scan.","tree":{"sha":"8de20f03a5688345df03869885ecb02fc100c82c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/8de20f03a5688345df03869885ecb02fc100c82c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/edd11e53b60f93f4a9abf080c3ed3dfc66fcedb8","verification":{"payload":"tree 8de20f03a5688345df03869885ecb02fc100c82c\nparent a7c5fec7afd0e2e24291384ea42183d1da74c462\nauthor 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784567203 +0300\ncommitter 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784567203 +0300\n\nfix(desktop): scan-flow layout — log fills its area, no growing scroll/gap\n\nThe scanning step was top-aligned inside a min-height-viewport main, so the\ncapped log left a tall empty tail (a scroll gap under Show details), and while\nthe log streamed it grew the page scroll. Now the flow fills the view and\ncenters short steps (safe-center, so long results still top-align + scroll),\nand the scanning step''s open log flexes to fill the leftover height and scrolls\nINTERNALLY — the streaming log never grows the page, leaves no gap, and doesn''t\nreflow. Closed log: status is centered, stable during the scan.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal5VoxsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQUrr2tOviBPsgvAEA/tVpGcXrddj2b40HzJiE\nv3imglvdlgWIjA1yHghASm4A/j7SWUrt5TE9NHxcCxLTZM95VbNhSrmj9zhJYabj\nUdIJ\n=Y9tW\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-20T17:15:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/edd11e53b60f93f4a9abf080c3ed3dfc66fcedb8","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKGVkZDExZTUzYjYwZjkzZjRhOWFiZjA4MGMzZWQzZGZjNjZmY2VkYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/a7c5fec7afd0e2e24291384ea42183d1da74c462","sha":"a7c5fec7afd0e2e24291384ea42183d1da74c462","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/a7c5fec7afd0e2e24291384ea42183d1da74c462"}],"sha":"edd11e53b60f93f4a9abf080c3ed3dfc66fcedb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/edd11e53b60f93f4a9abf080c3ed3dfc66fcedb8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/a7c5fec7afd0e2e24291384ea42183d1da74c462/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T17:05:28Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T17:05:28Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"message":"perf(scanner): share one cat-file reader across all deep-scan tips of a repo\n\nA many-branch repo now spawns a single git cat-file --batch for the whole deep\nscan instead of one per tip (each tip spec carries its own commit, so one reader\nserves them all). Fewer process spawns -> less fork/exec churn at scale. Rc-based\nsharing is safe: a repo''s deep scan is single-threaded (repos parallelize, tips don''t).","tree":{"sha":"80eb2bc0f004a1d49eee4fa76eb6f2eb9c700729","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/80eb2bc0f004a1d49eee4fa76eb6f2eb9c700729"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/a7c5fec7afd0e2e24291384ea42183d1da74c462","verification":{"payload":"tree 80eb2bc0f004a1d49eee4fa76eb6f2eb9c700729\nparent f13f3c39a851cadef3270c3e6ef70aa635846b3f\nauthor 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784567128 +0300\ncommitter 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784567128 +0300\n\nperf(scanner): share one cat-file reader across all deep-scan tips of a repo\n\nA many-branch repo now spawns a single git cat-file --batch for the whole deep\nscan instead of one per tip (each tip spec carries its own commit, so one reader\nserves them all). Fewer process spawns -> less fork/exec churn at scale. Rc-based\nsharing is safe: a repo''s deep scan is single-threaded (repos parallelize, tips don''t).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal5VWBsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQUrr2tOviBPu0aAD+PYKP1M4V6KNPKCTYXm20\nTwhzHTHVVFjWp3CjmV453GsBAM3fRk76NY0v6gt5nwr8UNCxDJSDqoUe5dwyDG5Y\n51oI\n=5k58\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-20T17:15:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/a7c5fec7afd0e2e24291384ea42183d1da74c462","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKGE3YzVmZWM3YWZkMGUyZTI0MjkxMzg0ZWE0MjE4M2QxZGE3NGM0NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/f13f3c39a851cadef3270c3e6ef70aa635846b3f","sha":"f13f3c39a851cadef3270c3e6ef70aa635846b3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/f13f3c39a851cadef3270c3e6ef70aa635846b3f"}],"sha":"a7c5fec7afd0e2e24291384ea42183d1da74c462","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/a7c5fec7afd0e2e24291384ea42183d1da74c462"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/f13f3c39a851cadef3270c3e6ef70aa635846b3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T16:58:40Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T16:58:40Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"message":"perf(scanner): diff-based deep scan — only scan each branch tip''s changes vs HEAD\n\nContent shared with HEAD is already covered by the working-tree pass, so a tip''s\nper-file scan drops from the whole tree to its (usually tiny) diff. Cuts the\nregex-heavy content scanning proportionally to tree size — faster AND cooler,\nwith no added parallelism/threads. Tree-level manifest checks respect the\nrestricted membership so unchanged files aren''t double-reported.\n\nA/B (31 tips): ~30% fewer CPU cycles, ~28% faster; scales with tree size.","tree":{"sha":"2a81c8f12082dc1bd935d2bbad1f02a1c6b3a295","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/2a81c8f12082dc1bd935d2bbad1f02a1c6b3a295"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/f13f3c39a851cadef3270c3e6ef70aa635846b3f","verification":{"payload":"tree 2a81c8f12082dc1bd935d2bbad1f02a1c6b3a295\nparent ef40f8d9bd88287e24b8e32a7bdccf8e1a7a6929\nauthor 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784566720 +0300\ncommitter 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784566720 +0300\n\nperf(scanner): diff-based deep scan — only scan each branch tip''s changes vs HEAD\n\nContent shared with HEAD is already covered by the working-tree pass, so a tip''s\nper-file scan drops from the whole tree to its (usually tiny) diff. Cuts the\nregex-heavy content scanning proportionally to tree size — faster AND cooler,\nwith no added parallelism/threads. Tree-level manifest checks respect the\nrestricted membership so unchanged files aren''t double-reported.\n\nA/B (31 tips): ~30% fewer CPU cycles, ~28% faster; scales with tree size.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal5TwBsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQUrr2tOviBPvlewD/RfpUqe8R1TnJjNjX7rnB\nJmCb4IIRBLKt+eQ8e7tqfBYA/iPNXbGnmEMOkcBvoxnzMverynOUfjGhFCSKmgQO\nKo0A\n=2PPv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-20T17:15:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/f13f3c39a851cadef3270c3e6ef70aa635846b3f","node_id":"C_kwDOTdCuhNoAKGYxM2YzYzM5YTg1MWNhZGVmMzI3MGMzZTZlZjcwYWE2MzU4NDZiM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commit/ef40f8d9bd88287e24b8e32a7bdccf8e1a7a6929","sha":"ef40f8d9bd88287e24b8e32a7bdccf8e1a7a6929","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/ef40f8d9bd88287e24b8e32a7bdccf8e1a7a6929"}],"sha":"f13f3c39a851cadef3270c3e6ef70aa635846b3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/f13f3c39a851cadef3270c3e6ef70aa635846b3f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/ef40f8d9bd88287e24b8e32a7bdccf8e1a7a6929/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T16:42:57Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T16:42:57Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"message":"fix: precision — veto decoder/shuffle-seed findings without a JS-code token\n\nKills false positives on inert package-manager data (yarn.lock, package-lock,\npnpm-lock, tarball SHA / integrity base64, pnpm *-index.json): a ''MDy'' substring\nin base64 + digit runs in hashes tripped the analyzer''s ''decoder + shuffle seed''\nrule.\n\n- HARD VETO: no decoder/obfuscation/seed finding unless the file contains a token\n  a working string-shuffle+eval decoder cannot exist without. List is COMPREHENSIVE\n  (all realistic sinks + string ops) so it can''t be dodged by swapping eval->Function\n  or charAt->.slice; inert metadata has none of them.\n- PROXIMITY: a shuffle seed must be an IIFE arg (\"str\",SEED) — never a bare number.\n- SURFACE EXCLUSIONS: lockfiles + CAS stores (.pnpm, pnpm store, _cacache,\n  *-index.json) are never content-scanned; doctor cache targets drop the CAS blob\n  stores (exec/install trees only).\n\nRegression fixtures for all four acceptance cases + an anti-evasion test.","tree":{"sha":"e47c40c284e33dda64b3d79a64779c3a68921947","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/e47c40c284e33dda64b3d79a64779c3a68921947"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/ef40f8d9bd88287e24b8e32a7bdccf8e1a7a6929","verification":{"payload":"tree e47c40c284e33dda64b3d79a64779c3a68921947\nparent a298b13d20b10877b4e32390b7b3143c3370c91c\nauthor 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784565777 +0300\ncommitter 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784565777 +0300\n\nfix: precision — veto decoder/shuffle-seed findings without a JS-code token\n\nKills false positives on inert package-manager data (yarn.lock, package-lock,\npnpm-lock, tarball SHA / integrity base64, pnpm *-index.json): a ''MDy'' substring\nin base64 + digit runs in hashes tripped the analyzer''s ''decoder + shuffle seed''\nrule.\n\n- HARD VETO: no decoder/obfuscation/seed finding unless the file contains a token\n  a working string-shuffle+eval decoder cannot exist without. List is COMPREHENSIVE\n  (all realistic sinks + string ops) so it can''t be dodged by swapping eval->Function\n  or charAt->.slice; inert metadata has none of them.\n- PROXIMITY: a shuffle seed must be an IIFE arg (\"str\",SEED) — never a bare number.\n- SURFACE EXCLUSIONS: lockfiles + CAS stores (.pnpm, pnpm store, _cacache,\n  *-index.json) are never content-scanned; doctor cache targets drop the CAS blob\n  stores (exec/install trees only).\n\nRegression fixtures for all four acceptance cases + an anti-evasion test.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal5