/dev/null), ignore a\nhostile system config (GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1), and pass --no-verify on\ncommit/amend/push — a hook planted in a scanned repo cannot execute during\nremediation.","tree":{"sha":"3c1b0c43bc36d96385518387407a5a599cbf06be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/3c1b0c43bc36d96385518387407a5a599cbf06be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/91bd7ee78b067a874e6fd6be192234ae92b147e4","verification":{"payload":"tree 3c1b0c43bc36d96385518387407a5a599cbf06be\nparent 90400bae334cca8bbe77ecfd5ac3dbe637a00c7b\nauthor 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784564554 +0300\ncommitter 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784564554 +0300\n\nfeat(core,github): harden own git operations against malicious repo hooks\n\nrun_git + github clone now disable hooks (core.hooksPath=/dev/null), ignore a\nhostile system config (GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1), and pass --no-verify on\ncommit/amend/push — a hook planted in a scanned repo cannot execute during\nremediation.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal5LShsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQUrr2tOviBPsSEwEAvyKqmFdepNjM5QRhao4o\nEDsDde14eGoCorScLojOFY4BALKk1FxHFS7iG+PRxLpgVVC2a+rsLgjuikVBF9LV\nrDkA\n=CfdQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-20T17:15:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_