8ff515985a7786523","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/a4be08a5a660067a8f95c9d8ff515985a7786523"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47571500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0fatihyildiz","id":47571500,"login":"0fatihyildiz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTcxNTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0fatihyildiz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/commits/e9a75ba775730143fa0dbc772d1591424f609a87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T16:15:10Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T16:15:10Z","email":"0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com","name":"0fatihyildiz"},"message":"fix(doctor): clear-cache no longer fails on / nukes global node_modules\n\ndoctor_clear_cache ran remove_dir_all on the whole target dir. For a global\nnode_modules root (/usr/local/lib/node_modules is root-owned; /opt/homebrew''s is\nuser-owned) that (a) failed with a raw \"Permission denied (os error 13)\" and\n(b) would have deleted every globally-installed package — those don''t regenerate.\n\nSplit behavior: regenerable caches (npx/node-gyp/TS/yarn/pnpm store) are still\nremoved whole; package roots keep the user''s packages and only shed the\nfingerprinted tainted files. Files the app can''t delete (root-owned) are reported\nwith an actionable ''sudo rm -f'' message instead of a raw errno. Adds is_package_root\n+ clear_cache_dir to wormward-doctor with tests.","tree":{"sha":"d58b6ef3af3f009bea3ab7b0f65bb88ce2d12a6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/trees/d58b6ef3af3f009bea3ab7b0f65bb88ce2d12a6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0fatihyildiz/wormward/git/commits/e9a75ba775730143fa0dbc772d1591424f609a87","verification":{"payload":"tree d58b6ef3af3f009bea3ab7b0f65bb88ce2d12a6f\nparent cb1c7904c74f4a2749d52536a385ed3f54b44c40\nauthor 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784564110 +0300\ncommitter 0fatihyildiz <0m.fatih.yildiz@gmail.com> 1784564110 +0300\n\nfix(doctor): clear-cache no longer fails on / nukes global node_modules\n\ndoctor_clear_cache ran remove_dir_all on the whole target dir. For a global\nnode_modules root (/usr/local/lib/node_modules is root-owned; /opt/homebrew''s is\nuser-owned) that (a) failed with a raw \"Permission denied (os error 13)\" and\n(b) would have deleted every globally-installed package — those don''t regenerate.\n\nSplit behavior: regenerable caches (npx/node-gyp/TS/yarn/pnpm store) are still\nremoved whole; package roots keep the user''s packages and only shed the\nfingerprinted tainted files. Files the app can''t delete (root-owned) are reported\nwith an actionable ''sudo rm -f'' message instead of a raw errno. Adds is_package_root\n+ clear_cache_dir to wormward-doctor with tests.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRAwsmkzWs0rQrK0p5Suva06+IE+wUCal5JjhsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQUrr2tOviBPt/FAEAxBL3zUOcqE6LHojFVc33\nl7ufcRveNIAXaI6dipGo0o4BAJHEBVRxK6TC839b3epZ1pNvyrJLDbOdqNdCL6H+\nvOEG\n=fMNa\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-20T17:15:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent