）：包含 shell_watch.rs、\nshell 整合腳本、observe_shell 設定、shell_activity 指令，以及冒泡閘門與\n觀察執行器中的終端機活動串接、隱私設定的開關與四種語系字串。保留 coding\nagent 觀察功能（observe_agents）不受影響。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"08fa0fb156c1044ff9996fabf30768fc1dd83af3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/08fa0fb156c1044ff9996fabf30768fc1dd83af3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/9c73f41340a97e9d43207fa98b1bb4393a6513c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/9c73f41340a97e9d43207fa98b1bb4393a6513c2","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKDljNzNmNDEzNDBhOTdlOWQ0MzIwN2ZhOThiMWJiNDM5M2E2NTEzYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/9a289d43fb9ebd577e97c852e4c97c1139e54322","sha":"9a289d43fb9ebd577e97c852e4c97c1139e54322","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/9a289d43fb9ebd577e97c852e4c97c1139e54322"}],"sha":"9c73f41340a97e9d43207fa98b1bb4393a6513c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/9c73f41340a97e9d43207fa98b1bb4393a6513c2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/9a289d43fb9ebd577e97c852e4c97c1139e54322/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T16:16:52Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T16:16:52Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"fix(語音): 改用 usize div_ceil 修正 Windows/Linux 編譯錯誤\n\naudio_ctx_for 以 (n_samples as i64).div_ceil() 計算編碼視窗，但 i64 的 div_ceil 仍屬 nightly 的 int_roundings 不穩定特性，在 stable toolchain 的 CI 上以 E0658 編譯失敗。n_samples 本為 usize，改在 usize 上做 div_ceil（該版本已 stable）再轉 i64，結果不變且不需 nightly。","tree":{"sha":"5a49dcc766e3871c6b3b47fc6ed4f3ea71fdb1f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/5a49dcc766e3871c6b3b47fc6ed4f3ea71fdb1f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/9a289d43fb9ebd577e97c852e4c97c1139e54322","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/9a289d43fb9ebd577e97c852e4c97c1139e54322","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKDlhMjg5ZDQzZmI5ZWJkNTc3ZTk3Yzg1MmU0Yzk3YzExMzllNTQzMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/a9b46bb06dc614b3ad655f330c63b1ba647f1562","sha":"a9b46bb06dc614b3ad655f330c63b1ba647f1562","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/a9b46bb06dc614b3ad655f330c63b1ba647f1562"}],"sha":"9a289d43fb9ebd577e97c852e4c97c1139e54322","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/9a289d43fb9ebd577e97c852e4c97c1139e54322"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/a9b46bb06dc614b3ad655f330c63b1ba647f1562/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T16:04:00Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T16:04:00Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"build: 升級版本號至 0.5.3","tree":{"sha":"c52eeb24adcd98d74b2e6588b361a3554ae21a7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/c52eeb24adcd98d74b2e6588b361a3554ae21a7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/a9b46bb06dc614b3ad655f330c63b1ba647f1562","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/a9b46bb06dc614b3ad655f330c63b1ba647f1562","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKGE5YjQ2YmIwNmRjNjE0YjNhZDY1NWYzMzBjNjNiMWJhNjQ3ZjE1NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/7cf10f41570d246f8011b2e67c4b9257e12b468b","sha":"7cf10f41570d246f8011b2e67c4b9257e12b468b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/7cf10f41570d246f8011b2e67c4b9257e12b468b"}],"sha":"a9b46bb06dc614b3ad655f330c63b1ba647f1562","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/a9b46bb06dc614b3ad655f330c63b1ba647f1562"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/7cf10f41570d246f8011b2e67c4b9257e12b468b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T15:56:21Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T15:56:21Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"fix(語音): 修正 macOS 選單攔截 ⌘ 組合鍵導致熱鍵無法錄製\n\nmacOS 自動安裝的預設 app menu，其 Edit 的 ⌘C/⌘V/⌘X/⌘A/⌘Z 與\n⌘W/⌘M/⌘H/⌘Q 等 key-equivalent 會在 AppKit 原生層先被吃掉，\nkeystroke 根本進不到 webview，push-to-talk 熱鍵錄製器因此抓不到\n這些組合鍵。Sage 沒有真正的選單列（每個視窗都 frameless、退出走\n系統匣），故改給它一個空的 app menu，讓所有組合鍵落到錄製器。\n文字欄位內的複製/貼上/全選仍由 WKWebView 自行處理，不影響使用者。","tree":{"sha":"2888fb0b0b690d720ba3772d1ae0d1de869180a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/2888fb0b0b690d720ba3772d1ae0d1de869180a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/7cf10f41570d246f8011b2e67c4b9257e12b468b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/7cf10f41570d246f8011b2e67c4b9257e12b468b","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKDdjZjEwZjQxNTcwZDI0NmY4MDExYjJlNjdjNGI5MjU3ZTEyYjQ2OGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/8e57cc19e54725f12a576513ab6f82ad7a0ffe15","sha":"8e57cc19e54725f12a576513ab6f82ad7a0ffe15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/8e57cc19e54725f12a576513ab6f82ad7a0ffe15"}],"sha":"7cf10f41570d246f8011b2e67c4b9257e12b468b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/7cf10f41570d246f8011b2e67c4b9257e12b468b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/8e57cc19e54725f12a576513ab6f82ad7a0ffe15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T15:22:52Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T15:22:52Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"fix(語音): 修正 macOS 語音辨識主執行緒死鎖並縮短辨識延遲\n\nmacOS 每次按住說話放開後都卡到 90 秒 timeout 才失敗：voice_stop_capture 是\n同步命令、於主執行緒 block 等待結果，而 SFSpeech 的 result handler 由主佇列\n派送，回呼因此永遠送不進來，形成死鎖。\n\n- voice_stop_capture 改為 async + spawn_blocking，讓主執行緒 run loop 保持運轉\n- macOS 辨識改用 run_on_main_thread 在主執行緒啟動 task、等待放到背景執行緒\n- macOS SFSpeechRecognizer 依 locale 快取，並於開麥時在背景預先建立\n- whisper 依實際語音長度縮放 audio_ctx，短句 encoder 成本降到約 1/5～1/7\n- async 化順帶讓 whisper 長句推論不再凍住 UI\n\n實測 macOS 辨識由 90s timeout 失敗變為約 100～230ms 成功。","tree":{"sha":"426fb2b7e1e8434fa85a125d544de8eb48b861d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/426fb2b7e1e8434fa85a125d544de8eb48b861d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/8e57cc19e54725f12a576513ab6f82ad7a0ffe15","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/8e57cc19e54725f12a576513ab6f82ad7a0ffe15","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKDhlNTdjYzE5ZTU0NzI1ZjEyYTU3NjUxM2FiNmY4MmFkN2EwZmZlMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/3e11d070a77a788cb9b644ea729560252805acb5","sha":"3e11d070a77a788cb9b644ea729560252805acb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/3e11d070a77a788cb9b644ea729560252805acb5"}],"sha":"8e57cc19e54725f12a576513ab6f82ad7a0ffe15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/8e57cc19e54725f12a576513ab6f82ad7a0ffe15"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122146613?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/following{/other_user}","gists