173689ab88fc0e00fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T08:11:25Z","email":"ariesaries951@gmail.com","name":"Aries"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T08:11:25Z","email":"ariesaries951@gmail.com","name":"Aries"},"message":"feat(語音): Windows 與 Linux 以 whisper.cpp 支援語音輸入\n\n語音辨識原本只有 macOS 有實作，其他平台按住說話會靜默失敗——\nuseVoice 直接 early return，既不開麥克風也不報錯。\n\n- 新增 voice_stt_whisper.rs，以 whisper.cpp 覆蓋 cfg(not(macos))，\n  Windows 與 Linux 共用同一份辨識器\n- 新增 voice_model.rs：約 190 MB 的模型不隨安裝檔發佈，改為首次使用\n  時徵得同意再下載，串流中同時計算 SHA-256，驗章通過才改名就位\n- VoiceStatus 增加 needs_model，把「這台機器不能辨識」與「模型還沒\n  下載」分開；前者是死路，後者是一個可以按的按鈕\n- useVoice 的靜默 early return 改為誠實狀態：缺模型就出現下載卡片，\n  其餘情況顯示真正的原因\n- 下載進度以 zustand store 為單一真相，透過 VOICE_MODEL_EVENT 在頭像\n  與設定兩個 webview 之間同步\n\n副作用：辨識端不再是純 Rust。whisper-rs-sys 會跑 cmake 與 bindgen，\n兩個 workflow 因此在 ubuntu 與 windows runner 上補裝 cmake、libclang。\n另加 .cargo/config.toml 與 cmake/portable-cpu.cmake 強制 GGML_NATIVE=OFF，\n否則 ggml 預設 -march=native 會把 CI runner 的 AVX-512 編進發行檔，\n在多數使用者的 CPU 上一開口就 SIGILL。\n\n已知限制：whisper 只有一個 zh 且以簡體為主，繁體僅能用 initial prompt\n偏置，仍會偶爾吐出簡體字。本次未在 Windows 實機驗證。","tree":{"sha":"c052809aa9214ca1ac7ac355b77b9734a5e4b8da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/c052809aa9214ca1ac7ac355b77b9734a5e4b8da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/1ef62858cc9e1c64ccfadd173689ab88fc0e00fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122146613?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603","id":122146613,"login":"YIHSUAN603","node_id":"U_kgDOB0fPNQ","organizatio