m.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T02:08:42Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"feat(自主移動): 改用 3×3 九宮格分區並讓夥伴避開使用者的注意力\n\n原本的移動語彙（left / right / corner / wander / center）只表達方向，\n模型無從判斷該去哪，夥伴常晃到使用者正在打字的位置擋住畫面。\n\n- 移動語彙改為九宮格單格（top-left…bottom-right）＋ stay，\n  resolveMoveTarget 改為 zoneToTarget，以格心定位再夾回螢幕內\n- 新增 focus_bounds command，回報焦點元件（取不到則退回焦點視窗）的\n  矩形與所在螢幕矩形；macOS 走 AX、Windows 走 UIA 加 Win32\n  MonitorFromRect，前端以比例換算格位，不做任何 DPI 計算\n- focus_bounds 沿用觀察的隱私閘門：觀察關閉或視窗在黑名單即拒絕，\n  連幾何都不外流；本身不帶任何文字\n- boundsToCell 把焦點矩形換成格位餵給模型，取不到就退回自由漫步\n- assess 階段由「可否決整輪」改為「只給提示」，同視窗靜音由 10 分鐘\n  縮短為 3 分鐘——先前專注在單一視窗工作時夥伴幾乎不說話\n- Cargo 新增 windows crate 0.62，與 uiautomation 既有版本一致，\n  不會多帶一份進依賴樹","tree":{"sha":"b0a557e5952a6d684d8a9f9c9bfa85968375e178","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/b0a557e5952a6d684d8a9f9c9bfa85968375e178"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/f5f4a0b4f4fe178c99614bcf6b82ecd3fbed2baa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/f5f4a0b4f4fe178c99614bcf6b82ecd3fbed2baa","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKGY1ZjRhMGI0ZjRmZTE3OGM5OTYxNGJjZjZiODJlY2QzZmJlZDJiYWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/b53edb05c13ac21adeaf6f1250d19c16f2721fdb","sha":"b53edb05c13ac21adeaf6f1250d19c16f2721fdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/b53edb05c13ac21adeaf6f1250d19c16f2721fdb"}],"sha":"f5f4a0b4f4fe178c99614bcf6b82ecd3fbed2baa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/f5f4a0b4f4fe178c99614bcf6b82ecd3fbed2baa"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/b53edb05c13ac21adeaf6f1250d19c16f2721fdb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T02:08:05Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T02:08:05Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"feat(夥伴): 新增移除已匯入寵物的功能\n\n匯入的寵物原本只能切換、不能移除，資料夾會一直累積在 <config>/pets/。\n\n- 後端新增 delete_pet，刪掉掃描時實際找到的資料夾，不用 id 重組路徑\n- 移除鈕採兩段式確認（此介面沒有 modal），切換選擇的寵物時自動解除\n  待確認狀態，避免誤刪別隻\n- 刪除後把 active_pet 清空回內建 Sage——讀不到的寵物本來就會 fallback","tree":{"sha":"c6c2ae7e394d60fddc304720be13f97a13962eb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/c6c2ae7e394d60fddc304720be13f97a13962eb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/b53edb05c13ac21adeaf6f1250d19c16f2721fdb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/b53edb05c13ac21adeaf6f1250d19c16f2721fdb","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKGI1M2VkYjA1YzEzYWMyMWFkZWFmNmYxMjUwZDE5YzE2ZjI3MjFmZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/ea057d7e10ef7d9a4c45b7f19040f79e7cbd831a","sha":"ea057d7e10ef7d9a4c45b7f19040f79e7cbd831a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/ea057d7e10ef7d9a4c45b7f19040f79e7cbd831a"}],"sha":"b53edb05c13ac21adeaf6f1250d19c16f2721fdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/b53edb05c13ac21adeaf6f1250d19c16f2721fdb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/ea057d7e10ef7d9a4c45b7f19040f79e7cbd831a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T02:07:38Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T02:07:38Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"feat(技能): 新增設定內的技能管理，可新增、編輯、刪除與匯入\n\n技能原本只能自己在 <config>/skills/ 手動放 SKILL.md，應用內看不到也改不了。\n\n- 後端新增 save_skill / delete_skill / import_skill，寫入\n  <config>/skills/<slug>/SKILL.md，同名（同 slug）視為覆寫\n- 路徑只接受淨化後的 slug；刪除改以重新掃描比對 name 找出資料夾，\n  使用者輸入永不直接組進路徑\n- import_skill 只複製 SKILL.md，不整包複製來源資料夾\n- 設定新增「技能」分頁，可列出、內嵌編輯、刪除與匯入資料夾\n- 編輯時鎖定名稱：改名會留下舊 slug 資料夾，請改用刪除後重新新增","tree":{"sha":"8ae50a5077f42c7100ce945acecb20bd408ccfa0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/8ae50a5077f42c7100ce945acecb20bd408ccfa0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/ea057d7e10ef7d9a4c45b7f19040f79e7cbd831a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/ea057d7e10ef7d9a4c45b7f19040f79e7cbd831a","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKGVhMDU3ZDdlMTBlZjdkOWE0YzQ1YjdmMTkwNDBmNzllN2NiZDgzMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/60abba9c54c1b1891e28f8eef5538375634f043a","sha":"60abba9c54c1b1891e28f8eef5538375634f043a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/60abba9c54c1b1891e28f8eef5538375634f043a"}],"sha":"ea057d7e10ef7d9a4c45b7f19040f79e7cbd831a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/ea057d7e10ef7d9a4c45b7f19040f79e7cbd831a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/60abba9c54c1b1891e28f8eef5538375634f043a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T15:23:21Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T15:23:21Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"perf(觀察): 快取 transcript 解析並讓 inbox 每輪只讀一次\n\n0.4.6 改為掃描所有 session 後，觀察 poller 每 3 秒對最多 8 個 active\nsession 各讀一次 64KB tail 並重讀整份 inbox，Windows+WSL 下這些讀取全\n走 \\\\wsl$ 9P 檔案系統，造成明顯 lag 且 session 越多越卡。\n\n- 新增 read_inbox_all：一次讀完 inbox 解析成 session→state map，取代每個\n  candidate 各重讀整份 inbox\n- 新增 PARSE_CACHE：以 mtime 快取已解析的 tail，mtime 未變即複用、跳過\n  檔案讀取與解析；每輪修剪至實際讀過的 path，避免隨歷史 session 膨脹\n- 狀態仍每輪重算，選擇行為（waiting_permission > running > idle）不變","tree":{"sha":"3872fb72c16a52a9b2046acca7751e99098731cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/3872fb72c16a52a9b2046acca7751e99098731cb"