":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T02:53:25Z","email":"ariesaries951@gmail.com","name":"Aries"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T02:53:25Z","email":"ariesaries951@gmail.com","name":"Aries"},"message":"feat(觀察): 新增觀察 WSL 內 coding agent session 的支援\n\n觀察功能原本只讀原生 Windows home 的 ~/.claude 與 ~/.codex，但使用者\n的 Claude Code / Codex 常跑在 WSL 裡，transcript 位於 WSL 檔案系統，\n導致完全讀不到。此前的 WSL 橋接只加在 agent-CLI 後端，觀察並未沿用。\n\n- 抽出 observe_home()：agent_cli_use_wsl 開啟時（僅 Windows）改解析\n  WSL 該 distro 的 $HOME UNC 路徑，其餘維持 OS home\n- 新增 wsl_home()：以 wsl.exe -- sh -c ''wslpath -w \"$HOME\"'' 取得 UNC\n  路徑，依 distro 快取，避免 poller 每次 spawn wsl.exe\n- agent_activity 與 reconcile_claude_hook 改用 observe_home，讓\n  transcript、inbox 與 hook 安裝一併指向 WSL home","tree":{"sha":"ef19a9e1759aeb20960fe58f78ca718fa9ebdc1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/ef19a9e1759aeb20960fe58f78ca718fa9ebdc1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/7cceb400aed5393a3946598433c3b721f4560076","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122146613?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603","id":122146613,"login":"YIHSUAN603","node_id":"U_kgDOB0fPNQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/subscriptions","type":"User",