bdbd459702dff1030484","sha":"9120bd55e5c8efa564cbbdbd459702dff1030484","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/9120bd55e5c8efa564cbbdbd459702dff1030484"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/6d0a7e3c32ff94cff80b27f4f4879136a47da5b0","sha":"6d0a7e3c32ff94cff80b27f4f4879136a47da5b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/6d0a7e3c32ff94cff80b27f4f4879136a47da5b0"}],"sha":"d67e21abadacd0f8b873e5c8281aa5354d5b44ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/d67e21abadacd0f8b873e5c8281aa5354d5b44ae"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/6d0a7e3c32ff94cff80b27f4f4879136a47da5b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T16:15:17Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T16:15:17Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"feat(自主移動): 新增夥伴桌面自主移動，AI 決定去向且與觀察脫鉤\n\n夥伴會自己在桌面上走動，讓桌面陪伴更有生命感。\n\n- 決策與動畫分層：LLM 只在既有主動搭話的 compose 便車上吐一個語意意圖\n  （left/right/wander/corner/center/stay），本地引擎再用 setPosition 平滑逐步\n  走到目標，絕不 per-frame 打模型，零額外 LLM 呼叫\n- 與觀察脫鉤：移動決策不再依賴 observe，idle 模式也能由角色個性決定去向；\n  開啟觀察只是讓決策多參考螢幕內容\n- 安全降級：AI 意圖優先且即時，空檔由 base 隨機漫步補；拖曳/thinking/talking／\n  聊天視窗開啟時暫停；Wayland/WSLg 無法移動視窗時完全不動\n- 新增 wander_enabled 設定（預設關閉）與設定面板開關，四語系文案齊備\n- 強化 dev 測試診斷：並行防護不再靜默吞掉，SILENT 但有移動時明確回報","tree":{"sha":"d85b9231449d0375d5c00b107815fb1457304e7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/d85b9231449d0375d5c00b107815fb1457304e7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/6d0a7e3c32ff94cff80b27f4f4879136a47da5b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/6d0a7e3c32ff94cff80b27f4f4879136a47da5b0","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKDZkMGE3ZTNjMzJmZjk0Y2ZmODBiMjdmNGY0ODc5MTM2YTQ3ZGE1YjA","parents":[{"html_url":"