120bd55e5c8efa564cbbdbd459702dff1030484","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/9120bd55e5c8efa564cbbdbd459702dff1030484"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/f4e8a05f90a29e9a57679973180512a963687661/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T15:32:15Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T15:32:15Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"feat(觀察): 讓夥伴讀取 Claude Code / Codex 對話狀態並主動反應\n\n新增獨立開關 observe_agents（預設關），把觀察來源從前景視窗擴充到\n使用者自己的 coding agent session：\n\n- 後端 agent_watch 模組 tail Claude ~/.claude/projects 與 Codex\n  ~/.codex/sessions 的 transcript JSONL，抽出對話內容、最近工具與粗狀態；\n  文字一律過 privacy::sanitize_text，開關關閉時完全不讀檔。\n- Claude 另以 file-drop hook（寫入 ~/.sage/agent-events.jsonl）取得精準\n  狀態（等權限／剛送 prompt／結束）；hook 疊加在 settings.json、保留其他\n  工具既有 entry，關閉開關時自動移除。Codex 無細顆粒 hook，僅靠 tail 判斷。\n- 前端 runner 新增輕量 poller，把最新狀態餵進兩段式 gate；偵測到「剛跑完／\n  等權限」高價值轉換時，經既有 idle 與每小時額度守門觸發一次搭話。gate\n  prompt 兩段都帶入 coding agent 現況，新動作可繞過「畫面未變」prefilter。","tree":{"sha":"e455487cd7f1b35f8a03be6cba3f80b8ccd20d60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/e455487cd7f1b35f8a03be6cba3f80b8ccd20d60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/f4e8a05f90a29e9a57679973180512a963687661","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/f4e8a05f90a29e9a57679973180512a963687661","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKGY0ZThhMDVmOTBhMjllOWE1NzY3OTk3MzE4MDUxMmE5NjM2ODc2NjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/ed44bf4ac76a287969563e93d76d94cde8a436c9","sha":"ed44bf4ac76a287969563e93d76d94cde8a436c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/ed44bf4ac76a287969563e93d76d94cde8a436c9"}],"sha":"f4e8a05f90a29e9a57679973180512a963687661","url":"