:{"date":"2026-07-22T16:45:32Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"Merge branch ''feat/0.4-memory-persistence''","tree":{"sha":"7afc5a6a68b67475332b2fa6a1e43766a8fbd252","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/7afc5a6a68b67475332b2fa6a1e43766a8fbd252"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/c13fdf4feb1cefadbeed0ef8bac174e86966a5ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/c13fdf4feb1cefadbeed0ef8bac174e86966a5ce","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKGMxM2ZkZjRmZWIxY2VmYWRiZWVkMGVmOGJhYzE3NGU4Njk2NmE1Y2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/9a590c61c445197efd9df539a88bbfd84cdd563b","sha":"9a590c61c445197efd9df539a88bbfd84cdd563b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/9a590c61c445197efd9df539a88bbfd84cdd563b"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/1217e3ca795c9de69821ac75e58198e2fa5b595f","sha":"1217e3ca795c9de69821ac75e58198e2fa5b595f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/1217e3ca795c9de69821ac75e58198e2fa5b595f"}],"sha":"c13fdf4feb1cefadbeed0ef8bac174e86966a5ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/c13fdf4feb1cefadbeed0ef8bac174e86966a5ce"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/1217e3ca795c9de69821ac75e58198e2fa5b595f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:44:08Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:44:08Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"feat(主動搭話): 注入唯讀記憶索引讓主動開場也記得使用者\n\n主動搭話走 observe/gate 兩段式流程，原本完全沒接記憶，導致「記得你」\n的夥伴主動開口時卻是記憶盲的。gate 新增 memoryPrefix 回呼，runner 以\n與聊天同一支 buildMemoryIndexMessage 注入；僅注入索引、不掛\nsave/recall/forget 工具（延續 observe 唯讀原則）。assess 與 compose\n兩段共用一次掃描，idle 模式仍會帶到 compose。","tree":{"sha":"7afc5a6a68b67475332b2fa6a1e43766a8fbd252","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/7afc5a6a68b67475332b2fa6a1e43766a8fbd252"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/1217e3ca795c9de69821ac75e58198e2fa5b595f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/1217e3ca795c9de69821ac75e58198e2fa5b595f","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKDEyMTdlM2NhNzk1YzlkZTY5ODIxYWM3NWU1ODE5OGUyZmE1YjU5NWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/abc55bdc160fc71449f7a7464c0bd936c584005a","sha":"abc55bdc160fc71449f7a7464c0bd936c584005a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/abc55bdc160fc71449f7a7464c0bd936c584005a"}],"sha":"1217e3ca795c9de69821ac75e58198e2fa5b595f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/1217e3ca795c9de69821ac75e58198e2fa5b595f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/abc55bdc160fc71449f7a7464c0bd936c584005a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:43:45Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:43:45Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"feat(記憶與持久化): 新增長期記憶、對話持久化與上下文預算\n\n0.4 為陪伴型 companion 補上跨重啟的記憶與對話留存：\n\n- 長期記憶：<config>/memory/ 每則一個 markdown 檔（frontmatter 同\n  skills），輕量索引每次請求注入、全文按需載入；模型以\n  save_memory/recall_memory/forget_memory 自管，預設開啟。後端\n  memory.rs 鏡射 skills.rs，slug 防路徑穿越。\n- 對話持久化：對話存 <config>/session.json 跨重啟還原；「清除」改為\n  封存到 <config>/sessions/，設定頁可瀏覽/刪除。後端 sessions.rs 以\n  不透明 JSON 陣列存取，id 防穿越。\n- 上下文預算：歷史送出前尾端截斷，assistant+tool 群組不腰斬。\n- 設定頁新增記憶開關、記憶管理器、封存瀏覽器；ChatWindow 新增\n  「開新對話（封存）」鈕；四語系字串同步。\n- 凍結 IPC contract 後平行實作；Rust 77 測試、前端測試涵蓋記憶工具、\n  索引注入、截斷與 chat store 皆綠。","tree":{"sha":"7ed79367db655385a18007520d44ac0ca66a9d54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/7ed79367db655385a18007520d44ac0ca66a9d54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/abc55bdc160fc71449f7a7464c0bd936c584005a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/abc55bdc160fc71449f7a7464c0bd936c584005a","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKGFiYzU1YmRjMTYwZmM3MTQ0OWY3YTc0NjRjMGJkOTM2YzU4NDAwNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/b5662026b02e65a04563f080a8c45761e5f8ca7d","sha":"b5662026b02e65a04563f080a8c45761e5f8ca7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/b5662026b02e65a04563f080a8c45761e5f8ca7d"}],"sha":"abc55bdc160fc71449f7a7464c0bd936c584005a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/abc55bdc160fc71449f7a7464c0bd936c584005a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/9a590c61c445197efd9df539a88bbfd84cdd563b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:39:56Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T16:41:05Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"fix(macOS簽章): release CI 信任設定改寫 System keychain 避免 CI 卡死\n\nadd-trusted-cert 寫 user domain（未帶 -d）會在無頭 runner 跳 SecurityAgent\n授權彈窗而永遠卡住——0.3.5 首次真正跑 release 時兩個 macOS job 都卡在此步約\n50 分鐘。改用 sudo 寫 admin domain 的 System keychain，非互動即可設為 code\nsigning 可信根。","tree":{"sha":"18999d0460a77e9cd11d7666e0635d4e52758e8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/18999d0460a77e9cd11d7666e0635d4e52758e8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/9a590c61c445197efd9df539a88bbfd84cdd563b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/9a590c61c445197efd9df539a88bbf