ithub.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/ea17d0eac6fc41e1b8f4a27ef3fbd717b4b56694","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKGVhMTdkMGVhYzZmYzQxZTFiOGY0YTI3ZWYzZmJkNzE3YjRiNTY2OTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/9811ef2ca2412e82b5218d1b59f68752271e5f62","sha":"9811ef2ca2412e82b5218d1b59f68752271e5f62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/9811ef2ca2412e82b5218d1b59f68752271e5f62"}],"sha":"ea17d0eac6fc41e1b8f4a27ef3fbd717b4b56694","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/ea17d0eac6fc41e1b8f4a27ef3fbd717b4b56694"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/9811ef2ca2412e82b5218d1b59f68752271e5f62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T14:43:26Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T14:43:26Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"build(macOS簽章): release CI 以固定自簽憑證簽章 App\n\n未簽章/ad-hoc 簽章的 App 沒有穩定簽章身分，macOS tccd 每次啟動都對不回先前\n授權而重跳權限（輔助使用、agent CLI 子行程觸發的資料夾存取）。改用一把固定的\n自簽 codesigning 憑證簽每個 release，designated requirement 固定後，TCC 授權可\n跨啟動、跨 updater 更新保留，只需授權一次。\n\n- 新增 scripts/gen-selfsigned-cert.sh：一次性產生自簽憑證，p12 須為 -legacy\n  格式，否則 Apple security import 讀不了現代 AES p12\n- release.yml 新增 macOS-only 匯入步驟：自建臨時 keychain → import →\n  add-trusted-cert 設為 code signing 可信根（自簽匯入後預設 NOT_TRUSTED，\n  不設信任 codesign 會拒用 identity）。憑證 PEM 由 security find-certificate\n  匯出，不經 openssl 以避開 CI 端對 legacy p12 的相容性問題\n- tauri-action 僅吃 APPLE_SIGNING_IDENTITY，不傳 APPLE_CERTIFICATE（免重複\n  匯入）與 APPLE_ID/APPLE_TEAM_ID（自簽無法公證，隔離仍靠 cask 的 xattr）\n- 需 4 個 GitHub Secrets：APPLE_CERTIFICATE、APPLE_CERTIFICATE_PASSWORD、\n  APPLE_SIGNING_IDENTITY、KEYCHAIN_PASSWORD","tree":{"sha":"da55084485fdd640c82f9212c7370c45df7716f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/da55084485fdd640c82f9212c7370c45df7716f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/9811ef2ca2412e82b5218d