eat(觀察): macOS 前景視窗改用 NSWorkspace 與 AX 讀取以免除螢幕錄製權限\n\n- 新增 context_macos.rs：以 NSWorkspace.frontmostApplication 取得前景 app 名稱與 pid，視窗標題改由 semantic_macos.rs 新增的 focused_window_title() 經 AX 讀取\n- macOS 不再編入 active-win-pos-rs：其後端為 CGWindowListCopyWindowInfo，讀 kCGWindowName 會觸發 Screen Recording TCC 權限\n- FocusedWindow 移除已無用的 window_id 欄位，semantic.rs 的 platform 模組改為 crate 可見以供 context_macos.rs 借用 AX FFI\n- README 與 en/ja/zh-CN/zh-TW 文案同步：說明觀察全程不截圖、macOS 只需「輔助使用」一項權限，未授權時降級為僅前景 app 名稱","tree":{"sha":"8359ea0550300d058fadcf5d78f6cbc61c46d0ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/8359ea0550300d058fadcf5d78f6cbc61c46d0ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/2cc4a47257a166bf8efd4d0bb62abf615789ef92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/2cc4a47257a166bf8efd4d0bb62abf615789ef92","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKDJjYzRhNDcyNTdhMTY2YmY4ZWZkNGQwYmI2MmFiZjYxNTc4OWVmOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/e722d90c1df140ca45dc9ac7978cd28962672c1a","sha":"e722d90c1df140ca45dc9ac7978cd28962672c1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/e722d90c1df140ca45dc9ac7978cd28962672c1a"}],"sha":"2cc4a47257a166bf8efd4d0bb62abf615789ef92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/2cc4a47257a166bf8efd4d0bb62abf615789ef92"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/e722d90c1df140ca45dc9ac7978cd28962672c1a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T07:58:59Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T07:58:59Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"build: 升級版本號至 0.3.3","tree":{"sha":"c633baed39edb5604a7766aa1847408a38edd2ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/c633baed39edb5604a7766aa1