純函式：焦點元件、選取文字、逐條畫面文字與截斷附註，全部走 i18n prompt namespace\n- 新增 idle.ts（IDLE_SKIP_SECONDS=600 與 shouldSkipWhenIdle）；runner 於配額檢查前查 activityState，使用者離開鍵盤即跳過本次提問但仍排下一次\n- runObserve 移除剝圖重試與 codex 純文字分支等 dead code，訊息永遠純文字，兩種 CLI 走同一路徑\n- 設定頁新增 macOS 輔助使用權限說明；四語系刪除 captureMode 三鍵、agentCliCodexObserve、gate.withScreenshot、gate.noScreenshot，新增 axPermissionHint、gate.withSemantic、gate.titleOnly、snapshot.* 並改寫隱私、零保留與 dev 測試文案\n- 重寫 gate 與 runObserve 測試、新增 idle 測試（111 全綠）","tree":{"sha":"09dc04f80422e9b8b0c4958f90bc75e83b98276b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/09dc04f80422e9b8b0c4958f90bc75e83b98276b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/6fdad08901db07d4c538fdb19da5a2d483847a62","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/6fdad08901db07d4c538fdb19da5a2d483847a62","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKDZmZGFkMDg5MDFkYjA3ZDRjNTM4ZmRiMTlkYTVhMmQ0ODM4NDdhNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/ffd3aa6085254f5002e3263b158c6f0527a220a0","sha":"ffd3aa6085254f5002e3263b158c6f0527a220a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/ffd3aa6085254f5002e3263b158c6f0527a220a0"}],"sha":"6fdad08901db07d4c538fdb19da5a2d483847a62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/6fdad08901db07d4c538fdb19da5a2d483847a62"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/f9d3d3b5c7bc9c4bd35686ffeb68f8839f227432/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T06:21:57Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T06:21:57Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"feat(觀察): 實作 Windows UIA 語意快照 backend\n\n- 採用 uiautomation crate 0.25（安全包裝 UIA COM API），每次呼叫\n  UIAutomation::new() 完成 per-thread CoInitializeEx，失敗時退用\n  new_direct() 沿用既有 COM 初始化\n- GetFocusedElement 後比對元素 process id 與剛通過 blocklist 的視窗\n  pid，不一致回 Err(\"focus changed\")，防止讀到別的視窗內容\n- focused_value 依序取 ValuePattern 值、TextPattern 全文（500 字上限）、\n  Name 屬性；selection 取 TextPattern GetSelection 文字，拿不到給空字串\n- 視窗文字自焦點元素沿 control-view 祖先鏈爬至頂層視窗，深度優先走訪\n  （深度 8、元素 300 上限），收集 Text/Edit/Document/Hyperlink/Button\n  的 Name 或 ValuePattern 值，單段 500 字、原始總量 4000 字即停\n- 全程無 unsafe / panic，COM 錯誤一律轉 Err(String)；共用層 semantic.rs\n  再做淨化與 200/2000 收緊上限","tree":{"sha":"8d60cf45098713160656cc457701c13098890daa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/8d60cf45098713160656cc457701c13098890daa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/f9d3d3b5c7bc9c4bd35686ffeb68f8839f227432","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/f9d3d3b5c7bc9c4bd35686ffeb68f8839f227432","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKGY5ZDNkM2I1YzdiYzljNGJkMzU2ODZmZmViNjhmODgzOWYyMjc0MzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/ffd3aa6085254f5002e3263b158c6f0527a220a0","sha":"ffd3aa6085254f5002e3263b158c6f0527a220a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/ffd3aa6085254f5002e3263b158c6f0527a220a0"}],"sha":"f9d3d3b5c7bc9c4bd35686ffeb68f8839f227432","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/f9d3d3b5c7bc9c4bd35686ffeb68f8839f227432"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/103f5a420c0cb22da836c5544913d05ebccb218b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T06:19:51Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T06:19:51Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"feat(觀察): 合併 Track M macOS AX 語意快照 backend","tree":{"sha":"af225705ebcc15c5227836ef0be3d649edd2cc42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/af225705ebcc15c5227836ef0be3d6