MmUzMjYzYjE1OGM2ZjA1MjdhMjIwYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/395e72f87296695acdcb2c4ff9d090760fdc5658","sha":"395e72f87296695acdcb2c4ff9d090760fdc5658","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/395e72f87296695acdcb2c4ff9d090760fdc5658"}],"sha":"ffd3aa6085254f5002e3263b158c6f0527a220a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/ffd3aa6085254f5002e3263b158c6f0527a220a0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/395e72f87296695acdcb2c4ff9d090760fdc5658/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T05:15:11Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T05:15:11Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"fix(觀察): 視窗截圖鎖定前景探測回報的焦點視窗\n\n- macOS 上 xcap 的 is_focused() 只比對擁有者 PID，前景 App 的每顆視窗都會命中，再由 z-order 決定，浮動面板可能被誤截\n- context 新增 current_focused() 帶出系統視窗 id（macOS 為 kCGWindowNumber），截圖與敏感視窗黑名單共用同一次前景查詢，確保檢查與拍攝為同一顆視窗\n- 視窗 id 缺失或過期時退回 is_focused() 掃描，再退回主螢幕（原有 fallback 保留）\n- Windows 不受影響：active-win-pos-rs 的 window_id 為 HWND(n) 格式無法解析，固定走 is_focused()，其底層 GetForegroundWindow 本就精確比對焦點視窗","tree":{"sha":"5415784367f0f81370c203eb445f060a68fbbb9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/5415784367f0f81370c203eb445f060a68fbbb9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/395e72f87296695acdcb2c4ff9d090760fdc5658","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/395e72f87296695acdcb2c4ff9d090760fdc5658","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKDM5NWU3MmY4NzI5NjY5NWFjZGNiMmM0ZmY5ZDA5MDc2MGZkYzU2NTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/7e846f9b14db21a79a2485ab7f795a7d180f23cc","sha":"7e846f9b14db21a79a2485ab7f795a7d180f23cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/7e846f9b14d