關與隱私說明\n- 觀察關閉且閒聊開啟時沿用搭話頻率，但完全不啟動視窗取樣與截圖\n- gate 新增 idle 模式，改用「看不到畫面」的純陪伴提示詞，並禁止假裝看得到工作內容\n- 四語系補上對應文案，新增測試驗證 idle 模式不附圖且不外洩視窗標題","tree":{"sha":"fee04130f52f0ffa3614696ca71dc9f81f3a438a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/fee04130f52f0ffa3614696ca71dc9f81f3a438a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/021f806f6f68ecbe90d336f6b603d21de06d018e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/021f806f6f68ecbe90d336f6b603d21de06d018e","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKDAyMWY4MDZmNmY2OGVjYmU5MGQzMzZmNmI2MDNkMjFkZTA2ZDAxOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/3c214e95ab6b06ac89b4c7222cc798d742d04514","sha":"3c214e95ab6b06ac89b4c7222cc798d742d04514","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/3c214e95ab6b06ac89b4c7222cc798d742d04514"}],"sha":"021f806f6f68ecbe90d336f6b603d21de06d018e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/021f806f6f68ecbe90d336f6b603d21de06d018e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/3c214e95ab6b06ac89b4c7222cc798d742d04514/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T01:55:52Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T01:55:52Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"docs(規劃): Roadmap 新增 0.5 雙向語音版本並順延後續版本編號\n\n- 長按/點擊 avatar push-to-talk:裝置端 STT → 既有聊天迴圈 → OS TTS 唸出回覆並鏡射至冒泡視窗\n- 夥伴可主動語音輸出:觀察冒泡可用唸的,預設關閉並遵守既有冷卻/每小時上限;pet 的 sage block 可宣告偏好嗓音\n- MCP 與工具順延至 0.6、本地模型後端順延至 0.7","tree":{"sha":"768d113e9842448a5f475c4a1e77c3577b2997f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/768d113e9842448a5f475c4a1e77c3577b2997f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/3c214e95ab6b06ac89b4c7222cc798d742d04514","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/3c214e95ab6b06ac89b4c7222cc798d742d04514","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKDNjMjE0ZTk1YWI2YjA2YWM4OWI0YzcyMjJjYzc5OGQ3NDJkMDQ1MTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/57a8cd64253759606c61836ac7e5bf15ac86a2b0","sha":"57a8cd64253759606c61836ac7e5bf15ac86a2b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/57a8cd64253759606c61836ac7e5bf15ac86a2b0"}],"sha":"3c214e95ab6b06ac89b4c7222cc798d742d04514","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/3c214e95ab6b06ac89b4c7222cc798d742d04514"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/57a8cd64253759606c61836ac7e5bf15ac86a2b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T01:49:56Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T01:49:56Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"feat(觀察): 新增敏感視窗黑名單、標題淨化與零保留 provider 防護\n\n- 新增 privacy.rs：內建黑名單（密碼管理器、登入頁、無痕視窗）加上使用者自訂名單，命中即拒絕截圖並以 [private] 遮蔽標題；防線在 Rust 端強制，webview 無法繞過\n- 視窗標題送出前淨化 email、長數字串（卡號/手機）與 API token 樣式\n- 截圖預設改為僅前景視窗（observe_capture_mode），背景視窗不再入鏡，可於設定切回全螢幕\n- 觀察請求預設帶 provider.data_collection = \"deny\"（observe_deny_data_collection），無可用 provider 時剝除截圖退回純標題重試一次\n- 設定介面新增截圖範圍、零保留開關與黑名單編輯，i18n 四語系同步\n- README Privacy 段落揭露新防護與免費模型資料政策取決於 provider 的事實\n\n副作用：舊版 settings.json 透過 serde default 無痛升級；開啟零保留後部分免費視覺模型可能無可用 provider，觀察自動退回純標題模式。","tree":{"sha":"dd1e70962e9dd2a3fe25dcfe39fe4257a4ebf4d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/dd1e70962e9dd2a3fe25dcfe39fe4257a4ebf4d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/57a8cd64253759606c61836ac7e5bf15ac86a2b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/57a8cd64253759606c61836ac7e5bf15ac86a2b0","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKDU3YThjZDY0MjUzNzU5NjA2YzYxODM2YWM3ZTViZjE1YWM4NmEyYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/a6c2558c093f83a8c65a4e6f7b8b2cb15d36daf9","sha":"a6c2558c093f83a8c65a4e6f7b8b2cb15d36daf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/a6c2558c093f83a8c65a4e6f7b8b2cb15d36daf9"}],"sha":"57a8cd64253759606c61836ac7e5bf15ac86a2b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/57a8cd64253759606c61836ac7e5bf15ac86a2b0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/a6c2558c093f83a8c65a4e6f7b8b2cb15d36daf9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T01:30:05Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T01:30:05Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"fix(發佈): Homebrew 安裝改由 cask postflight 清除隔離標記\n\n- Homebrew 6 已移除 --no-quarantine 旗標，原安裝指令會報 invalid option\n- cask 產生模板新增 postflight，安裝後自動執行 xattr -cr 清除隔離標記\n- README 與 release note 模板的安裝指令同步移除 --no-quarantine","tree":{"sha":"08420c1ef7fb7bc1830ec1cb25e1d67198dca7f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/08420c1ef7fb7bc1830ec1cb25e1d67198dca7f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/a6c2558c093f83a8c65a4e6f7b8b2cb15d36daf9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/a6c2558c093f83a8c65a4e6f7b8b2cb15d36daf9","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKGE2YzI1NThjMDkzZjgzYThjNjVhNGU2ZjdiOGIyY2IxNWQzNmRhZjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/ef2985d057a94450df686a81bc9d9de0eccf1e53","sha":"ef2985d057a94450df686a81bc9d9de0eccf1e53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/ef2985d057a94450df686a81bc9d9de0eccf1e53"}],"sha":"a6c2558c093f83a8c65a4e6f7b8