d9699f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T16:40:17Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T16:40:17Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"feat(小夥伴): 新增個性與搭話頻率設定並支援主題色\n\n- 設定視窗新增人設與搭話頻率欄位：內建 Sage 存於全域設定\n  （custom_persona、cooldown、每小時上限），選用寵物時寫回其\n  pet.json 的 sage 區塊（新增 update_pet_sage 指令，保留未知欄位）\n- 觀察迴圈改依有效 cooldown（寵物覆寫全域）推導隨機間隔，\n  並新增每小時氣泡配額，達上限時直接略過詢問省下 LLM 呼叫\n- pet.json 支援 sage.theme.accent，useCompanionTheme 依主題色\n  重染共用 CSS 變數，氣泡與聊天視窗改吃變數以跟隨主題\n- 視窗拖曳與吸附定位改用邏輯像素並抽出 snapPosition，\n  修正混合 DPI 多螢幕下的偏移；頭像移動時氣泡自動跟隨\n- clean-appledouble 清理範圍納入 .git，避免 ._pack-*.idx\n  造成 git 指令噴 non-monotonic index 錯誤","tree":{"sha":"0001a801681528a15bfbfe47c0f2b9b2b11fdf57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/0001a801681528a15bfbfe47c0f2b9b2b11fdf57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/7b578e3efeaaae02778ae3248d0450f4bd9699f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/7b578e3efeaaae02778ae3248d0450f4bd9699f4","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKDdiNTc4ZTNlZmVhYWFlMDI3NzhhZTMyNDhkMDQ1MGY0YmQ5Njk5ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/c53ec4ffe60aed324f779303aad9a14972317ddf","sha":"c53ec4ffe60aed324f779303aad9a14972317ddf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/c53ec4ffe60aed324f779303aad9a14972317ddf"}],"sha":"7b578e3efeaaae02778ae3248d0450f4bd9699f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/7b578e3efeaaae02778ae3248d0450f4bd9699f4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/c53ec4ffe60aed324f779303aad9a14972317ddf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T16:01:54Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T16:01:54Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"fix(小夥伴): 向左移動改以鏡像跑步動畫顯示，修正方向錯誤\n\n- 生成的 spritesheet 中 running-left 列實際仍是朝右的畫格，\n  導致無論向左或向右拖曳都只顯示向右跑的動畫\n- run-left 手勢改共用 running-right 列，由 PetSprite 以\n  CSS scaleX(-1) 水平鏡像呈現，左右切換時畫格不會重置\n- 同步更新 petAtlas 的列對應與鏡像測試","tree":{"sha":"fd513060256311d83ae6306f0bba32a8ed03848b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/fd513060256311d83ae6306f0bba32a8ed03848b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/c53ec4ffe60aed324f779303aad9a14972317ddf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/c53ec4ffe60aed324f779303aad9a14972317ddf","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKGM1M2VjNGZmZTYwYWVkMzI0Zjc3OTMwM2FhZDlhMTQ5NzIzMTdkZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/82ecf93deaef56848faca7ae7b506d914acc2df7","sha":"82ecf93deaef56848faca7ae7b506d914acc2df7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/82ecf93deaef56848faca7ae7b506d914acc2df7"}],"sha":"c53ec4ffe60aed324f779303aad9a14972317ddf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/c53ec4ffe60aed324f779303aad9a14972317ddf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/82ecf93deaef56848faca7ae7b506d914acc2df7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T15:51:21Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T15:51:21Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"feat: 新增 agent CLI 工具權限分級並更換 Sage 應用圖示\n\n- 新增 read_only / edit / full 三級工具權限：設定頁可選擇，聊天視窗標題列可快速循環切換\n- Claude 依權限對應 allowedTools 白名單與 --permission-mode；Codex 對應 --sandbox 等級；觀察（observe）一律唯讀\n- permission 欄位以 #[serde(skip)] 由 Rust 端從設定注入，前端無法自行提權\n- 更換應用圖示為 Sage 品牌（sage.svg、app-icon.svg 與全套 Tauri icons），移除預設 vite/tauri svg\n- package-lock.json 版號同