"name":"Aries"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T05:12:10Z","email":"ariesaries951@gmail.com","name":"Aries"},"message":"feat(小夥伴): 新增自訂小夥伴支援，可替換內建 Sage 角色\n\n放入符合 Codex pet 契約（hatch-pet skill 產出）的資料夾到 <config>/pets/，\n即可用其動畫 spritesheet 當頭像；pet.json 內選填的 sage 區塊可自訂人格與\n主動搭話節奏，缺少時 Sage 依名稱與描述合成人格。\n\n- 後端新增 pets.rs（list_pets / read_pet / read_pet_atlas）與 active_pet 設定\n- 新增 persona / companion store、PetSprite 與 petAtlas 渲染 spritesheet\n- 人格改為 request-only system message 注入，聊天歷史保持乾淨\n- gate 系統提示拆為 persona + protocol，主動搭話節奏可被夥伴覆寫\n- 設定新增夥伴挑選器，model 欄位改用 select 修正 datalist 過濾問題\n- UI 文案與 i18n（en / ja / zh-CN / zh-TW）以 {{name}} 帶入夥伴名稱","tree":{"sha":"160d07f6afa83ff168bedac96063f04c26dbdb67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/160d07f6afa83ff168bedac96063f04c26dbdb67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/c308edeca4c7abfaccfe9b6db39034ee9f733d1a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122146613?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603","id":122146613,"login":"YIHSUAN603","node_id":"U_kgDOB0fPNQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YIHSUAN603","user_view_type":"public"},"html