est，Rust 端安裝 webkit 相依後執行 cargo test\n- 新增 release.yml：推送 v* tag 時以 tauri-action 建置 macOS（Apple Silicon + Intel）、Windows、Linux 安裝檔並建立草稿 Release\n- README 新增 CI / Releases 章節，說明發版步驟與 macOS 未簽章的開啟方式","tree":{"sha":"01702f65527c7eac2de7a2c1b305ab47558502cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/trees/01702f65527c7eac2de7a2c1b305ab47558502cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/git/commits/4cbb2257613c84bbd03921586bf38217638f14af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/4cbb2257613c84bbd03921586bf38217638f14af","node_id":"C_kwDOTdMWcNoAKDRjYmIyMjU3NjEzYzg0YmJkMDM5MjE1ODZiZjM4MjE3NjM4ZjE0YWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commit/938fc27b6b3817b03ce77a2d155b785a49bc4b99","sha":"938fc27b6b3817b03ce77a2d155b785a49bc4b99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/938fc27b6b3817b03ce77a2d155b785a49bc4b99"}],"sha":"4cbb2257613c84bbd03921586bf38217638f14af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/4cbb2257613c84bbd03921586bf38217638f14af"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YIHSUAN603/Sage/commits/938fc27b6b3817b03ce77a2d155b785a49bc4b99/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-19T16:15:55Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-19T16:15:55Z","email":"arieschao@richitech.com.tw","name":"AriesChao"},"message":"feat: 新增 skill 系統，模型可依任務自動載入技能指示\n\n- Rust 新增 skills.rs：list_skills / read_skill 掃描 <config_dir>/skills/*/SKILL.md，手寫 frontmatter 行解析（零新相依），以解析後名稱匹配避免 path traversal，沿用 256KB 上限\n- IPC 契約三端同步（contract / real / mock）：新增 SkillMeta 型別與 list_skills / read_skill 指令\n- 前端新增 use_skill ToolSpec：描述內嵌技能目錄、參數以 enum 限定名稱，失敗一律回錯誤字串\n- chat store 每次 send 重掃技能目錄並條件式註冊工具，掃描失敗不影響聊天\n- 新增 tests/skills.test.ts 與 Rust 解析單元測試，README 補放置路徑與 SKILL.md 格式說明","tree":{"sh