ps://api.github.com/users/rahunanthanan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahunanthanan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rahunanthanan/federated-ops-console/commits/e5faedea588ded1a9621609e90c31160c6fdba85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T08:28:36Z","email":"rahunanthanan@gmail.com","name":"rahunanthanan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T08:28:36Z","email":"rahunanthanan@gmail.com","name":"rahunanthanan"},"message":"Add caching strategy, Playwright e2e tests, Rsbuild variant, and load diagnostics\n\n- Cache-Control headers on manifest/remoteEntry.js/hashed chunks, with a\n  version-aware script cache in loadRemote.ts so a manifest version bump\n  invalidates without a full reload.\n- Two new Playwright specs (remote mount, network-failure fallback) plus a\n  fix for a pre-existing flaky locator in journey.spec.ts.\n- Parallel Rsbuild/Rspack build config for both apps via\n  @module-federation/rsbuild-plugin, alongside the existing webpack build.\n- Live attempt/timeout/retry status indicator in RemoteLoader, behind a\n  SHOW_LOAD_DIAGNOSTICS flag.","tree":{"sha":"3f70514cf93b3574080be1a73de197ebbcf3dd9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rahunanthanan/federated-ops-console/git/trees/3f70514cf93b3574080be1a73de197ebbcf3dd9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rahunanthanan/federated-ops-console/git/commits/e5faedea588ded1a9621609e90c31160c6fdba85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13075225?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahunanthanan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahunanthanan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahunanthanan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahunanthanan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"htt