8fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T15:30:00Z","email":"tansarijkm25@gmail.com","name":"Tasmin Ansari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T15:30:00Z","email":"tansarijkm25@gmail.com","name":"Tasmin Ansari"},"message":"fix(main-app): serve mockServiceWorker.js from the host too\n\nPOST /songs was 404ing against the host''s own port instead of being\nintercepted by MSW. Root cause: a Service Worker''s scope is tied to the\ndocument''s origin, not to which federated module''s code called\nworker.start(). When MusicLibrary runs inside main-app, the page is\nmain-app''s, so MSW tried to register mockServiceWorker.js against\nmain-app''s origin — where it never existed, only in music-library''s\npublic folder. Registration silently failed, so writes fell through to\nthe real network and 404''d. Fix: commit the identical worker script in\nboth apps'' public/ folders.","tree":{"sha":"203155a5ac8dc01f847c4be63b27d577f0fad258","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tasmin75/music-library-project/git/trees/203155a5ac8dc01f847c4be63b27d577f0fad258"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tasmin75/music-library-project/git/commits/d2181737ab618470340acf08b3d7ec24059e18fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123582322?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tasmin75/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tasmin75/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tasmin75/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tasmin75/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tasmin75","id":123582322,"login":"tasmin75","node_id":"U_kgDOB123cg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tasmin75/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tasmin75/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tasmin75/repos","site_a