07-30T08:43:01Z","email":"rogozinds@gmail.com","name":"Dmitrii Rogozin"},"message":"Remove stale infra/ (old GCS bucket, superseded by Firebase Hosting)\n\nThe gs://mf-portal bucket this Terraform managed was already destroyed\nwhen the deploy target moved to Firebase Hosting. Verified the new setup\nextensively via manual deploy (every route, both themes, hard refresh on\ndeep links) before removing this — see ARCHITECTURE.md §11.1.\n\nAlso deletes the now-empty remote state object at\ngs://module-federation-lab-tfstate/mf-portal/default.tfstate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ede0a7b0b9dced863ca2dd262973a17e756f6ed0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microfrontend-lab/mf-portal/git/trees/ede0a7b0b9dced863ca2dd262973a17e756f6ed0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microfrontend-lab/mf-portal/git/commits/211e716bab6d3ef8036561c62a85de231e84e5c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1339320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rogozinds","id":1339320,"login":"rogozinds","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMzkzMjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/microfrontend-lab/mf-portal/commit/211e716bab6d3ef8036561c62a85de231e84e5c3","node_id":"C_kwDOTd3K9doAKDIxMWU3MTZiYWI2ZDNlZjgwMzY1NjFjNjJhODVkZTIzMWU4NGU1YzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/microfrontend-lab/mf-portal/commit/4beb16f8c13e8ff584115e498b33d4c2ed184df3","sha":"4beb16f8c13e8ff584115e498b33d4c2ed184df3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microfrontend-lab/mf-portal/commits/4beb16f8c13e8ff584115e498b33d4c2ed184df3"}],"sha":"211e716bab6d3ef8036561c62a85de231e84e5c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microfrontend-lab/mf-portal/commits/211e716bab6d3ef8036561c62a85de231e84e5c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1339320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rogozinds","id":1339320,"login":"rogozinds","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMzkzMjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microfrontend-lab/mf-portal/commits/4beb16f8c13e8ff584115e498b33d4c2ed184df3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T11:40:56Z","email":"rogozinds@gmail.com","name":"Dmitrii Rogozin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T11:40:56Z","email":"rogozinds@gmail.com","name":"Dmitrii Rogozin"},"message":"Move deploy target to Firebase Hosting\n\nGCS''s website{ not_found_page } SPA fallback never actually applied via the\nstorage.googleapis.com/<bucket>/<path> REST endpoint every repo here uses —\nonly via GCS''s dedicated website-serving path, which nothing in this org\ngoes through. That made every deep-link refresh (e.g. /apps/chart) 404 at\nthe infra layer, before any app code ran. mf-portal is the one app users\nnavigate to and refresh directly, so it''s the one place this was worth\nfixing: Firebase Hosting''s native rewrites solve it for free, plus give a\nCDN and managed HTTPS.\n\npublicPath also moves from a hardcoded /mf-portal/ (matching the old nested\nbucket path) to ''/'', since Firebase serves from its own domain root. That\nincidentally fixes the portal''s nav links too, which had been missing the\nbucket-name prefix (no basename ever matched the old deploy path).\n\nThe old gs://mf-portal bucket has been torn down. infra/ is kept for now,\nflagged stale, pending deletion once this is verified via a real CI deploy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a3c98b5f7ea7218f34331442a68f976bbc6c8d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microfrontend-lab/mf-portal/git/trees/5a3c98b5f7ea7218f34331442a68f976bbc6c8d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microfrontend-lab/mf-portal/git/commits/4beb16f8c13e8ff584115e498b33d4c2ed184df3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1339320?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rogozinds","id":1339320,"login":"rogozinds","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMzkzMjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds/orgs","received_