,"login":"Oldzhay34","node_id":"U_kgDOD0IBgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Oldzhay34/ecommerce-microservice/commit/16573ec646e6acf1f1be22e52046fb7e59f66680","node_id":"C_kwDOTd8OC9oAKDE2NTczZWM2NDZlNmFjZjFmMWJlMjJlNTIwNDZmYjdlNTlmNjY2ODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Oldzhay34/ecommerce-microservice/commit/a4810ec20ffef317a68d853edfd107c5876b2080","sha":"a4810ec20ffef317a68d853edfd107c5876b2080","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oldzhay34/ecommerce-microservice/commits/a4810ec20ffef317a68d853edfd107c5876b2080"}],"sha":"16573ec646e6acf1f1be22e52046fb7e59f66680","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oldzhay34/ecommerce-microservice/commits/16573ec646e6acf1f1be22e52046fb7e59f66680"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/255984001?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Oldzhay34","id":255984001,"login":"Oldzhay34","node_id":"U_kgDOD0IBgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oldzhay34/ecommerce-microservice/commits/a4810ec20ffef317a68d853edfd107c5876b2080/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T11:27:14Z","email":"olcaykarahasan05@gmail.com","name":"Oldzhay34"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T11:27:14Z","email":"olcaykarahasan05@gmail.com","name":"Oldzhay34"},"message":"add jackson-datatype-jsr310 to product-service\n\nOrderCreatedListenerTest failed in CI: Java 8 date/time type\nLocalDateTime not supported. Spring Boot 4''s default web starter\npulls Jackson 3 (tools.jackson), which no longer transitively brings\nthe classic Jackson 2 jsr310 module. product-service explicitly\ndepends on Jackson 2 (jackson-databind) for its ObjectMapper-based\nlisteners/adapters but never added the jsr310 companion, so\nOrderCreatedListener couldn''t deserialize OrderCreatedEventPayload''s\ncreatedAt field - a real bug affecting production message handling,\nnot just the test.","tree":{"sha":"4b0c6b3ffaadab3328da5057e6f4526bbb2982e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oldzhay34/ecommerce-microservice/git/trees/4b0c6b3ffaadab3328da5057e6f4526bbb2982e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oldzhay34/ecommerce-microservice/git/commits/a4810ec20ffef317a68d853edfd107c5876b2080","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/255984001?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Oldzhay34","id":255984001,"login":"Oldzhay34","node_id":"U_kgDOD0IBgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Oldzhay34/ecommerce-microservice/commit/a4810ec20ffef317a68d853edfd107c5876b2080","node_id":"C_kwDOTd8OC9oAKGE0ODEwZWMyMGZmZWYzMTdhNjhkODUzZWRmZDEwN2M1ODc2YjIwODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Oldzhay34/ecommerce-microservice/commit/42877c7801f1eb16a9f306d04378d55af55236e4","sha":"42877c7801f1eb16a9f306d04378d55af55236e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oldzhay34/ecommerce-microservice/commits/42877c7801f1eb16a9f306d04378d55af55236e4"}],"sha":"a4810ec20ffef317a68d853edfd107c5876b2080","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oldzhay34/ecommerce-microservice/commits/a4810ec20ffef317a68d853edfd107c5876b2080"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/255984001?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Oldzhay34","id":255984001,"login":"Oldzhay34","node_id":"U_kgDOD0IBgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oldzhay34/ecommerce-microservice/commits/42877c7801f1eb16a9f306d04378d55af55236e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T10:43:03Z","email":"olcaykarahasan05@gmail.com","name":"Oldzhay34"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T10:43:03Z","email":"olcaykarahasan05@gmail.com","name":"Oldzhay34"},"message":"fix trigger scripts breaking on Postgres $$ function bodies in CI\n\nnotification-service CI failed: Spring''s default schema.sql statement\nsplitter uses a naive single '';'' separator and doesn''t understand\nPostgres dollar-quoted ($$) function bodies, so it split\nCREATE FUNCTION statements apart at the first '';'' inside the body\n(e.g. inside a RAISE EXCEPTION message), producing invalid SQL.\n\nFixes all 6 non-Flyway trigger scripts (product, order, payment,\ncart, review, PromptEngineering) plus notification-service''s\nschema.sql by setting spring.sql.init.separator to a custom '';;''\ndelimiter and terminating every top-level statement with '';;'' while\nleaving the single '';'' characters inside function bodies untouched.\nmedia-service is unaffected since Flyway''s own SQL parser already\nhandles $$ blocks correctly.","tree":{"sha":"f65a870ea2c4d5f37d21576d70c72a4bc92943eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oldzhay34/ecommerce-microservice/git/trees/f65a870ea2c4d5f37d21576d70c72a4bc92943eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oldzhay34/ecommerce-microservice/git/commits/42877c7801f1eb16a9f306d04378d55af55236e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/255984001?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Oldzhay34","id":255984001,"login":"Oldzhay34","node_id":"U_kgDOD0IBgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Oldzhay34/ecommerce-microservice/commit/42877c7801f1eb16a9f306d04378d55af55236e4","node_id":"C_kwDOTd8OC9oAKDQyODc3Yzc4MDFmMWViMTZhOWYzMDZkMDQzNzhkNTVhZjU1MjM2ZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Oldzhay34/ecommerce-microservice/commit/0e565ce638126fda9a0431abdb98b0873504888e","sha":"0e565ce638126fda9a0431abdb98b0873504888e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oldzhay34/ecommerce-microservice/commits/0e565ce638126fda9a0431abdb98b0873504888e"}],"sha":"42877c7801f1eb16a9f306d04378d55af55236e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oldzhay34/ecommerce-microservice/commits/42877c7801f1eb16a9f306d04378d55af55236e4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/255984001?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Oldzhay34","id":255984001,"login":"Oldzhay34","node_id":"U_kgDOD0IBgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oldzhay34/ecommerce-microservice/commits/0e565ce638126fda9a0431abdb98b0873504888e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T10:27:43Z","email":"olcaykarahasan05@gmail.com","name":"Oldzhay34"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T10:27:43Z","email":"olcaykarahasan05@gmail.com","name":"Oldzhay34"},"message":"add database security triggers across all services\n\nAdds defensive PostgreSQL triggers (idempotent CREATE OR REPLACE\nFUNCTION / DROP-CREATE TRIGGER) per service: type/range invariants,\nidentity and financial immutability, illegal state-transition guards,\nmedia_asset soft-delete enforcement, and outbox_event JSON payload\nvalidation. Wires spring.sql.init + defer-datasource-initialization\nfor the Hibernate ddl-auto services, and disables it for the H2 test\nprofiles so the Postgres-only PL/pgSQL scripts never run against H2.\n\nAlso fixes UserPersistenceAdapterTest, which switched to H2 without\ndisabling spring.sql.init and would otherwise try to run the new\ntrigger script against it.","tree":{"sha":"f021505911a910c2474205ee1cf01463b941e792","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oldzhay34/ecommerce-microservice/git/trees/f021505911a910c2474205ee1cf01463b941e792"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Oldzhay34/ecommerce-microservice/git/commits/0e565ce638126fda9a0431abdb98b0873504888e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/255984001?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oldzhay34/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ol