subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rogozinds","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microfrontend-lab/todo-app/commits/6f3f9c1190a1476f57a1675519d17528ad1fde02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T11:42:24Z","email":"rogozinds@gmail.com","name":"Dmitrii Rogozin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T11:42:24Z","email":"rogozinds@gmail.com","name":"Dmitrii Rogozin"},"message":"Fix publicPath: hardcoded prefix broke embedded chunk loading in production\n\noutput.publicPath was hardcoded to /mf-todo-app/ in production, which the\nbrowser resolves against whatever page the remote is embedded in — not this\napp''s own origin. Confirmed live: embedding in mf-portal 404''d on this\napp''s own (non-shared) chunks with \"missing: https://mf-portal.web.app/\nmf-todo-app/<id>.js\". SCAFFOLD.md §10 already mandated ''auto'' for exactly\nthis reason; this app had drifted from it.\n\nThe comment justifying the hardcode (fixing standalone /list/:id refresh\nvia GCS''s SPA fallback) doesn''t hold up either — that fallback never\napplies via the storage.googleapis.com/<bucket>/<path> URL this app is\nactually served through, so it wasn''t fixing anything real in production.\n\nAlso adds the mf-portal Firebase Hosting origin to the documented CORS\nexample, needed since the portal now fetches this bucket''s remoteEntry.js\ncross-origin from https://mf-portal.web.app.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cbb792e65a8ccbcebe04bf8f4c8ede37b8c5fd33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microfrontend-lab/todo-app/git/trees/cbb792e65a8ccbcebe04bf8f4c8ede37b8c5fd33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microfrontend-lab/todo-app/git/commits/6f3f9c1190a1476f57a1675519d17528ad1fde02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1339320?v=4","ev