ork together with Workflow 1 (content generation) and Workflow 3 (publishing).","tree":{"sha":"4954c15bb8d981ad389e53d967ebdd69f44cacb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arturolg20/n8n-social-media-automation-/git/trees/4954c15bb8d981ad389e53d967ebdd69f44cacb0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/arturolg20/n8n-social-media-automation-/git/commits/3b527fadb3d9f13fb9e7e37f51fec3b2181df763","verification":{"payload":"tree 4954c15bb8d981ad389e53d967ebdd69f44cacb0\nparent 9202b6dae381718394d29429f9bc7e7ba62732b3\nauthor arturolg20 <harutodarkness@gmail.com> 1784569643 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784569643 +0200\n\nAdd Workflow 2 review and regeneration automation\n\nAdd the second workflow of the AI social media automation system.\r\n\r\nThis workflow manages the review stage, allowing users to regenerate AI-generated text or images before publication.\r\n\r\nMain features:\r\n- Load review session from Data Table\r\n- Regenerate text or image on demand\r\n- Store version history\r\n- Update the review session\r\n- Return updated content through webhook\r\n\r\nDesigned to work together with Workflow 1 (content generation) and Workflow 3 (publishing).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXl8rCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtHsQAAjqay2AwPSSiN1Ay6etLged\ncOYq9QdbNaSGzVkXvl6droByxA8A+YL4uKlCVMEYWGbs0/qUNHI+2PMDHgrZOTFz\nm+30TUFGcOZQJozNbspIYG56X89dohNIv7x9WSBdmyiGTsQ3TOFiZeqNOBQ4h/BL\noSZC3vz+wl4397frXRvtFsGRBZclm0Uxs6Adr83h1rwl98ucfUDkf/qhrJcNfk+7\n4Mfb2Z6XBGH16SeHfrodxdjtXd3Y3sKrzbVrLk3jOmMqoLEvX/gr28WdWLDWJ1XW\nUre91OKgGNdnPexV7CRrRWolRrGqrefNrbY5z1uitowlZtCztoQcbwti48FaTj++\nzXI/5n1uQlpmSstTx/2ANF3tQdjk9jnALfZej9AL/JAmIUwcBnATy9oDvAKrsADp\nnLfimaqZRFRrtsEklCkZpn77Q2KSf7+wEBjkT8hp5Sm9sOUkADO6D57VrX8tE9Wd\ngGygpcfXVxYPnFnbzp7+hFEJq9GaM2bu1FpmzLwEI3AmhsPZx+MSjl1/aQHj+rDt\nw9Opq1FUKIEzMiyrTr08du5U2acjKWmRPkCsJzs7qFLg26Kmg0HPUl1kIYJ2BO/6\nUxsb9iZsicO9NY53NY/PFzEtYt3A4vdCIe2kKHEtaKe/BRuezLRfjTdYcAMexkjJ\nv6oxhDj4x3wHgMuLZKB2\n=